#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.title"
msgstr "Kugadziridzwa kwemutemo wekodzero kunodiwa kuchengetedzwa kwenyika"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.tldr"
msgstr "TL;DR: LLMs dzeChinese (kusanganisira DeepSeek) dzakadzidziswa pane yangu archive isiri pamutemo yemabhuku nemapepa — iyo yakakura kwazvo pasi rose. Nyika dzekuMadokero dzinoda kugadzirisa mutemo wekodzero sechinhu chekuchengetedzwa kwenyika."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.subtitle"
msgstr "nyaya dzinoperekedza naTorrentFreak: <a %(torrentfreak)s>yekutanga</a>, <a %(torrentfreak_2)s>yechipiri</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text1"
msgstr "Hazvina kumbopfuura nguva refu, \"maraibhurari emumvuri\" aive achifa. Sci-Hub, iyo archive huru isiri pamutemo yemapepa ezvidzidzo, yakanga yamira kutora mabasa matsva, nekuda kwematare. \"Z-Library\", iyo huru raibhurari isiri pamutemo yemabhuku, yakaona vanofungidzirwa kuti vakagadzira vacho vachisungwa pamhosva dzekodzero. Vakakwanisa kutiza kusungwa kwavo, asi raibhurari yavo haisi pasi pekutyisidzirwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text2"
msgstr "Panguva iyo Z-Library yakatarisana nekuvharwa, ndakanga ndatove nebackup yeraibhurari yese uye ndakanga ndichitsvaga chikuva chekuigara. Izvo zvaive zvikonzero zvangu zvekutanga Anna’s Archive: kuenderera mberi kwemishoni iri kumashure kweizvi zvirongwa zvekare. Kubva ipapo takura kuva raibhurari huru yemumvuri pasi rose, tichigamuchira zvinopfuura 140 miriyoni zvinyorwa zvine kodzero mumhando dzakasiyana — mabhuku, mapepa ezvidzidzo, magazini, mapepanhau, nezvimwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text3"
msgstr "Chikwata changu neni tiri vafundisi. Tinotenda kuti kuchengetedza uye kugamuchira mafaera aya kuri pamutemo. Maraibhurari pasi rose ari kuona kuderedzwa kwemari, uye hatigone kuvimba nemagariro evanhu kumakambaniwo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text4"
msgstr "Ipapo AI yakauya. Kambani dzese dzakakura dzinovaka LLMs dzakatibata kuti dzidzidzise pane data redu. Mazhinji (asi kwete ese!) makambani eUS akafunga zvakare kana achinge aona hunhu husiri pamutemo hwebasa redu. Mukupesana, makambani eChinese akagamuchira nemufaro muunganidzwa wedu, sezviri pachena asina kunetseka nezvepamutemo. Izvi zvinokosha sezvo China iri musaina kune angangoita ese makondirakiti makuru epasi rose ekodzero."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text5"
msgstr "Takapa mukana wepamusoro-soro kumakambani anenge makumi matatu. Mazhinji acho makambani eLLM, uye mamwe ma data brokers, avo vachazotengesa muunganidzwa wedu. Mazhinji acho ndeeChinese, kunyangwe takashandawo nemakambani kubva kuUS, Europe, Russia, South Korea, neJapan. DeepSeek <a %(arxiv)s>akabvuma</a> kuti shanduro yapfuura yakadzidziswa pane chikamu chemuunganidzwa wedu, kunyangwe vari kutaura zvishoma nezvemhando yavo yazvino (zvingangodaro zvakare dzidziswa pane data redu zvakadaro)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text6"
msgstr "Kana nyika dzekuMadokero dzichida kuramba dziri pamberi mumujaho weLLMs, uye pakupedzisira, AGI, inoda kufunga zvakare nezve chinzvimbo chayo pamutemo wekodzero, uye nekukurumidza. Kunyangwe uchibvumirana nesu kana kwete pane nyaya yedu yemaitiro, izvi zvino zvave nyaya yehupfumi, uye kunyange yekuchengetedzwa kwenyika. Masimba ese ari kuvaka masayendisiti epamusoro, super-hackers, uye super-militaries. Rusununguko rweruzivo rwave nyaya yekupona kwenyika idzi — kunyange nyaya yekuchengetedzwa kwenyika."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text7"
msgstr "Chikwata chedu chinobva pasi rose, uye hatina kuwirirana kwakakosha. Asi tinokurudzira nyika dzine mitemo yakasimba yekodzero kuti dzishandise kutyisidzira uku kugadzirisa. Saka chii chekuita?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text8"
msgstr "Kurudziro yedu yekutanga iri nyore: pfupisa nguva yekodzero. MuUS, kodzero inopihwa kwemakore makumi manomwe mushure mekufa kwemunyori. Izvi hazvina musoro. Tinogona kuunza izvi zvinoenderana nemapatent, ayo anopihwa kwemakore makumi maviri mushure mekufaira. Izvi zvinofanirwa kuve zvakakwana nguva kune vanyori vemabhuku, mapepa, mimhanzi, hunyanzvi, uye mamwe mabasa ekugadzira, kuti vabhadharwe zvizere nezvavakaita (kusanganisira mapurojekiti enguva refu akadai sekugadziriswa kwemafirimu)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text9"
msgstr "Ipapo, pakutanga, vagadziri vemitemo vanofanirwa kusanganisira carve-outs yekuchengetedza kwakawanda uye kuparadzira zvinyorwa. Kana kurasikirwa kwemari kubva kune vatengi vega kuri kunetsekana kukuru, kugoverwa pamunhu kunogona kuramba kuchirambidzwa. Mukudzoka, avo vanokwanisa kubata mafaera makuru — makambani anodzidzisa LLMs, pamwe nemaraibhurari nemamwe maarchive — angafukidzwa nezvakasarudzwa izvi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text10"
msgstr "Dzimwe nyika dzatotanga kuita shanduro yeizvi. TorrentFreak <a %(torrentfreak)s>yakashuma</a> kuti China neJapan zvakaunza AI kunze kwemitemo yavo yekodzero. Hazvina kujeka kwatiri kuti izvi zvinobatana sei nezvibvumirano zvepasi rose, asi zvinonyatso kupa chifukidziro kumakambani avo emunyika, izvo zvinotsanangura zvatiri kuona."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text11"
msgstr "Kana iri Anna’s Archive — ticharamba tichiita basa redu repasi pevhu rakadzika mumaitiro. Asi chishuwo chedu chikuru kupinda muchiedza, uye kuwedzera kukanganisa kwedu zviri pamutemo. Ndapota gadzirisai kodzero."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.signature"
msgstr "- Anna nechikwata (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.postscript"
msgstr "Verenga nyaya dzinoperekedza naTorrentFreak: <a %(torrentfreak)s>yekutanga</a>, <a %(torrentfreak_2)s>yechipiri</a>"

