#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winner.text5"
msgstr "Ndapota ona <a %(all_isbns)s>chinyorwa chepachinyorwa chekutanga</a> kuti uwane rumwe ruzivo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winner.text6"
msgstr "Takapa dambudziko rekuti tivandudze izvi. Taitarisa kupa mubayiro wekutanga we $6,000, wechipiri we $3,000, uye wechitatu we $1,000. Nekuda kwekupindura kukuru uye kutumirwa kunoshamisa, tasarudza kuwedzera mubayiro zvishoma, uye kupa mubayiro wechitatu kune vanhu vana ve $500 imwe neimwe. Vahwina vari pazasi, asi iva nechokwadi chekuona zvese zvakatumirwa <a %(annas_archive)s>pano</a>, kana dhawunirodha <a %(a_2025_01_isbn_visualization_files)s>torrent yedu yakasanganiswa</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.first"
msgstr "Pekutanga $6,000: phiresky"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.first.text1"
msgstr "Iyi <a %(phiresky_github)s>mibairo</a> (<a %(annas_archive_note_2951)s>Gitlab comment</a>) inongova zvese zvataida, uye zvimwe! Takanyanya kufarira sarudzo dzinoshamisa dzekuona (kunyangwe kutsigira ma shaders etsika), asi iine runyorwa rwakazara rwezvakatemwa. Takafarirawo kuti zvinhu zvese zvinomhanya nekusvava sei, kushandiswa kuri nyore (kusina kana backend), minimap inehungwaru, uye tsananguro yakazara mubhurogi ravo <a %(phiresky_github)s>chinyorwa</a>. Basa rinoshamisa, uye rakakodzera kuhwina!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second"
msgstr "Pechipiri $3,000: hypha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text1"
msgstr "Imwe <a %(annas_archive_note_2913)s>mibairo</a> inoshamisa. Haisi yakasiyana-siyana seyekutanga, asi isu takafarira kuonekwa kwayo kwepamusoro-soro pamusoro pekutanga (nzvimbo-yekuzadza curve, miganhu, kutumidza, kujekesa, panning, uye zooming). A <a %(annas_archive_note_2971)s>comment</a> naJoe Davis yakatibata:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.quote"
msgstr "“Kunyange zvazvo mativi akakwana uye rectangles zvichifadza pamwero wepamusoro, hazvipi nzvimbo yepamusoro mumamiriro ekumepu. Ndinotenda kuti kusarongeka kuri mumaitiro aya eHilbert kana echinyakare Morton hakusi kukanganisa asi chinhu. Sezvakaita Italy's inozivikanwa nebhutsu-yakaita miganhu inoita kuti izivikanwe pakarepo pamamepu, hunhu hwakasiyana hweaya ma curves hunogona kushanda semapoinzi ekuziva. Iyi kusiyana-siyana inogona kuvandudza ndangariro dzenzvimbo uye kubatsira vashandisi kuzvionera, zvichigona kuita kuti kuwana nzvimbo dzakasiyana kana kuona mapatani kuve nyore.”"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text2"
msgstr "Uye zvichiri zvakawanda zvesarudzo dzekuona uye kudhirowa, pamwe neUI inonyanya kuyerera uye intuitive. Nzvimbo yechipiri yakasimba!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third1"
msgstr "Pechitatu $500 #1: maxlion"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third1.text1"
msgstr "Mune iyi <a %(annas_archive_note_2940)s>mibairo</a> takanyatsoda mhando dzakasiyana dzekuona, kunyanya kuenzanisa uye maonero evaparidzi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third2"
msgstr "Pechitatu $500 #2: abetusk"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third2.text1"
msgstr "Kunyange isiri iyo yakanyatsogadzirwa UI, iyi <a %(annas_archive_note_2917)s>mibairo</a> inotarisa zvakawanda zvemabhokisi. Takanyatsoda chimiro chayo chekuenzanisa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third3"
msgstr "Pechitatu $500 #3: conundrumer0"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third3.text1"
msgstr "Senge pekutanga, iyi <a %(annas_archive_note_2975)s>mibairo</a> yakatishamisa nekusiyana-siyana kwayo. Pakupedzisira izvi ndizvo zvinoita kuti chishandiso chekuona chive chikuru: kusiyana-siyana kwakanyanya kwevashandisi vane simba, uku kuchengetedza zvinhu zviri nyore kune vashandisi vepakati."

#, fuzzy
