msgstr "Pechitatu $500 #4: charelf"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third4.text1"
msgstr "Yekupedzisira <a %(annas_archive_note_2947)s>mibairo</a> yekuwana mubayiro iri yakapusa, asi ine zvimwe zvinhu zvakasiyana zvataida chaizvo. Takafarira kuti vanoratidza sei kuti mangani maDatasets anofukidza ISBN chaiyo sechiyero chekuvimbika/kuzivikanwa. Takafarirawo zvakanyanya kuve nyore asi kushanda kwekushandisa opacity slider yekuenzanisa."

