#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aac"
msgstr "<strong>AAC.</strong> AAC (Anna’s Archive Container) chinhu chimwe chete chine <strong>metadata</strong>, uye zvichida <strong>binary data</strong>, zvose zvisingachinjiki. Iine chiziviso chakasarudzika pasi rose, chinonzi <strong>AACID</strong>."

