msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.collection"
msgstr "<strong>Collection.</strong> Imwe neimwe AAC iri muchirongwa, icho pachirevo chiri runyorwa rweAACs dzine pfungwa dzakafanana. Izvi zvinoreva kuti kana ukachinja zvakanyanya mafomati emetadata, unofanira kugadzira chirongwa chitsva."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.records-files"
msgstr "<strong>“records” and “files” collections.</strong> Nechibvumirano, zvinowanzova nyore kuburitsa “records” uye “files” semapoka akasiyana, kuitira kuti aburitswe panguva dzakasiyana, semuenzaniso zvichienderana nemitengo yekukwenya. “Record” iboka remetadata chete, rine ruzivo rwakadai semazita emabhuku, vanyori, ISBNs, nezvimwe, nepo “files” ari mapoka ane mafaera chaiwo (pdf, epub)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid"
msgstr "<strong>AACID.</strong> Mafomati eAACID ndiwo: <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__{collection}__{ISO 8601 timestamp}__{collection-specific ID}__{shortuuid}</code>. Semuenzaniso, AACID chaiyo yatakaburitsa ndeye <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z__22433983__URsJNGy5CjokTsNT6hUmmj</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection"
msgstr "<code>{collection}</code>: zita rechirongwa, rinogona kunge riine mavara eASCII, manhamba, uye underscores (asi kwete double underscores)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.iso8601"
msgstr "<code>{ISO 8601 timestamp}</code>: shanduro pfupi yeISO 8601, nguva dzose muUTC, semuenzaniso <code>20220723T194746Z</code>. Nhamba iyi inofanira kuwedzera zvishoma nezvishoma pakuburitswa kwega kwega, kunyange zvazvo zvazvinoreva chaizvo zvinogona kusiyana nechirongwa. Tinokurudzira kushandisa nguva yekukwenya kana kugadzira ID."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection-id"
msgstr "<code>{collection-specific ID}</code>: chiziviso chakatarwa nechirongwa, kana zvichibvira, semuenzaniso Z-Library ID. Inogona kusiiwa kana kupfupikiswa. Inofanira kusiiwa kana kupfupikiswa kana AACID ichizopfuura mavara 150."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.shortuuid"
msgstr "<code>{shortuuid}</code>: UUID asi yakamanikidzwa kuASCII, semuenzaniso uchishandisa base57. Parizvino tinoshandisa <a %(github_skorokithakis_shortuuid)s>shortuuid</a> Python library."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid-range"
msgstr "<strong>AACID range.</strong> Sezvo AACIDs dzine timestamps dzinowedzera zvishoma nezvishoma, tinogona kushandisa izvozvo kuratidza minda mukati mechirongwa chakasarudzwa. Tinoshandisa fomati iyi: <code style=\"color: blue\">aacid__{collection}__{from_timestamp}--{to_timestamp}</code>, uko timestamps dzinosanganisirwa. Izvi zvinowirirana neISO 8601 notation. Minda inoramba ichienda, uye inogona kuwirirana, asi kana paine kuwirirana inofanira kunge iine marekodhi akafanana neakaburitswa kare muchirongwa ichocho (sezvo AACs dzisina kuchinjika). Marekodhi asipo haatenderwi."

