#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.name"
msgstr "Zita redhairekitori rinofanira kunge riri AACID range, rakaprefixed ne <code style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</code>, uye risina suffix. Semuenzaniso, imwe yeburitswa kwedu ine dhairekitori rinonzi<br><code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_files__20230808T055130Z--20230808T055131Z</span></code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.contents"
msgstr "Dhairekitori rinofanira kunge riine mafaera edata eAACs ese mukati meiyo range yakatarwa. Faira rega rega redhata rinofanira kunge riine AACID yaro sezita refaira (hapana extensions)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.tip"
msgstr "Zvinokurudzirwa kuita kuti mafolda aya ave nyore kubata, semuenzaniso asapfuura 100GB-1TB imwe neimwe, kunyange zvazvo kurudziro iyi inogona kuchinja nekufamba kwenguva."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.torrents"
msgstr "<strong>Torrents.</strong> Mafaira emetadata nemafolda edata ebinary anogona kubatanidzwa mu torrents, ne torrent imwe neimwe yemetadata faira, kana torrent imwe neimwe yefaira redata rebinary. Ma torrents anofanira kuva nezita refaira/dhairekitori rekutanga pamwe ne <code>.torrent</code> sekuwedzera kwezita refaira ravo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.heading"
msgstr "Muenzaniso"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text1"
msgstr "Ngatitarisei kuburitswa kwedu kweZ-Library kwakapfuura semuenzaniso. Kunoumbwa nemakolekishini maviri: “<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>” uye “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>”. Izvi zvinotibvumira kuti titorere uye tiburitse metadata marekodhi kubva kumafaira chaiwo emabhuku. Saka, takaburitsa ma torrents maviri ane metadata mafaira:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text2"
msgstr "Takaburitsawo boka re torrents nemafolda edata ebinary, asi chete kune “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>” kolekishini, 62 yose:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text3"
msgstr "Nekumhanya <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z.jsonl.zst</span></code> tinogona kuona zviri mukati:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text4"
msgstr "Mune ino nyaya, imetadata yebhuku sezvakataurwa neZ-Library. Pamusoro-soro tine chete “aacid” uye “metadata”, asi hapana “data_folder”, sezvo pasina data rebinary rinopindirana. AACID ine “22430000” seID huru, iyo yatinogona kuona yakatorwa kubva ku “zlibrary_id”. Tinogona kutarisira mamwe maAAC mukolekishini iyi kuti ave nechimiro chimwe chete."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text5"
msgstr "Zvino ngatimhanye <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230809T223215Z.jsonl.zst</span></code>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text6"
msgstr "Iyi imetadata yeAAC diki kwazvo, kunyange zvazvo chikamu chikuru cheAAC iyi chiri kune imwe nzvimbo mufaira rebinary! Mushure mezvose, tine “data_folder” panguva ino, saka tinogona kutarisira kuti data rebinary rinopindirana riri pa <code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230808T051504Z</span>/<span style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z__22433983__NRgUGwTJYJpkQjTbz2jA3M</span></code>. “Metadata” ine “zlibrary_id”, saka tinogona kuibatanidza nyore nyore neAAC inopindirana mukolekishini ye “zlib_records”. Taisakwanisa kubatanidza nenzira dzakasiyana-siyana, semuenzaniso kuburikidza neAACID — mureza hauna kuraira izvozvo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text7"
msgstr "Cherechedza kuti hazvidiwi kuti munda we “metadata” pachawo uve JSON. Unogona kuva tambo ine XML kana chero imwe data fomati. Unogona kutombochengeta ruzivo rwemetadata mubinary blob inopindirana, semuenzaniso kana iri data rakawanda."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.heading"
msgstr "Mhedziso"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text1"
msgstr "Nemureza uyu, tinogona kuita kuburitswa zvishoma nezvishoma, uye nyore kuwedzera mitsva yedata. Isu tatova nemamwe kuburitswa anofadza ari mupombi!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text2"
msgstr "Tinovimbawo kuti zvichava nyore kune mamwe maraibhurari emumvuri kuti aenzanise makolekishini edu. Mushure mezvose, chinangwa chedu ndechekuchengetedza ruzivo uye tsika dzevanhu nekusingaperi, saka kuwanda kwekudzokorora kuri nani."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion"
msgstr "- Anna nechikwata (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.title"
msgstr "Kuvandudzwa kwaAnna: archive yakavhurika zvizere, ElasticSearch, 300GB+ yemifananidzo yemabhuku"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.tldr"
msgstr "Tanga tichishanda nguva dzose kupa imwe nzira yakanaka neAnna’s Archive. Hezvino zvimwe zvezvinhu zvatawana nguva pfupi yadarika."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.text1"
msgstr "NeZ-Library ichidzika uye (vanonzi) vatangi vayo vachisungwa, tanga tichishanda nguva dzose kupa imwe nzira yakanaka neAnna’s Archive (hatizobatanidzi pano, asi unogona kuGoogle). Hezvino zvimwe zvezvinhu zvatawana nguva pfupi yadarika."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source"
msgstr "Anna’s Archive yakavhurika zvizere"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text1"
msgstr "Tinotenda kuti ruzivo runofanira kuva rwemahara, uye kodhi yedu pachayo haina kusarudzika. Takaburitsa kodhi yedu yese paGitlab yedu yakazvimirira: <a %(annas_archive)s>Anna’s Software</a>. Isu tinoshandisawo tracker yenyaya kuronga basa redu. Kana uchida kubatana nekusimudzira kwedu, iyi inzvimbo yakanaka yekutanga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text2"
msgstr "Kukupa kuravira kwezvinhu zvatiri kushanda pazviri, tora basa redu richangobva kuitika pakuvandudza kwekuita kwevatengi. Sezvo tisati taita pagination, taizowanzo dzorera mapeji ekutsvaga marefu kwazvo, ane 100-200 mhinduro. Hatina kuda kucheka mhinduro dzekutsvaga nekukurumidza, asi izvi zvaireva kuti zvaizoderedza mamwe midziyo. Kune izvi, takaita hunyengeri hudiki: takaputira mhinduro zhinji dzekutsvaga mumashoko eHTML (<code><!-- --></code>), uyezve takanyora Javascript diki yaizobata kana mhinduro yaitofanira kuoneka, panguva iyo taizoburitsa chirevo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text3"
msgstr "DOM \"virtualization\" yakaitwa mumitsara 23, hapana chikonzero chemaraibhurari anoyevedza! Iyi ndiyo mhando yekodhi inokurumidza uye inoshanda yaunopedzisira uine kana uine nguva shoma, uye matambudziko chaiwo anoda kugadziriswa. Zvinonzi kutsvaga kwedu kunoshanda zvakanaka pamidziyo inononoka!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text4"
msgstr "Kumwe kuedza kukuru kwaive kwekugadzirisa kuvaka dhatabhesi. Patakatanga, takangounganidza masosi akasiyana-siyana. Zvino tave kuda kuachengeta achienderana nenguva, saka takanyora mapurogiramu akati wandei ekurodha metadata mitsva kubva kumapfork maviri eLibrary Genesis, uye kuibatanidza. Chinangwa hachisi kungoita kuti izvi zvibatsire kune yedu archive, asi kuita kuti zvinhu zvive nyore kune chero munhu anoda kutamba nemetadata yelibrary yeshadow. Chinangwa chingave cheJupyter notebook ine metadata inonakidza dzakasiyana-siyana dziripo, kuti tigone kuita tsvakiridzo yakawanda senge kuona kuti <a %(blog)s>chikamu cheISBNs chachengetwa nekusingaperi</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text5"
msgstr "Pakupedzisira, takagadzirisa hurongwa hwedu hwekupa. Iwe zvino unogona kushandisa kadhi rechikwereti kuisa mari zvakananga mumawallet edu ecrypto, pasina chaizvo kuda kuziva chero chinhu nezve cryptocurrencies. Ticharamba tichiongorora kuti izvi zvinoshanda sei mukuita, asi ichi chinhu chikuru."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es"
msgstr "Chinja kuElasticSearch"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text1"
msgstr "Imwe yematikiti edu <a %(annas_archive)s></a> yaive mubhegi rematambudziko nehurongwa hwedu hwekutsvaga. Takashandisa MySQL full-text search, sezvo tanga tine data yedu yese muMySQL zvakadaro. Asi yaive nemiganhu yayo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem1"
msgstr "Mimwe mibvunzo yaitora nguva yakareba, kusvika pakuti yaizotora zvese zvakabatana."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem2"
msgstr "Nezvazvino MySQL ine shoma shoma shoko kureba, kana index yako inogona kuve yakakura chaizvo. Vanhu vakataura kuti havagone kutsvaga \"Ben Hur\"."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem3"
msgstr "Kutsvaga kwaingova nekukurumidza kana kwese kwakarodha mumemory, izvo zvaitida kuti tiwane muchina unodhura kuti tiite izvi, pamwe nemirairo yekurodha index pakutanga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem4"
msgstr "Hatina kukwanisa kuwedzera zviri nyore kuvaka maficha matsva, senge zvirinani <a %(wikipedia_cjk_characters)s>tokenization yemitauro isina nzvimbo</a>, kusefa/kufanira, kuronga, \"waireva here\" mazano, autocomplete, uye zvichingodaro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text2"
msgstr "Mushure mekutaurirana nevanyanzvi vakawanda, takasarudza ElasticSearch. Hazvina kunge zvakakwana (mazano avo ekutanga \"waireva here\" uye maficha eautocomplete haana kunaka), asi kazhinji zvave nani kupfuura MySQL yekutsvaga. Hatina <a %(youtube)s>kufara</a> nekushandisa izvozvi kune chero data rakakosha (kunyangwe vakaita <a %(elastic_co)s>budiriro</a> yakawanda), asi kazhinji tiri kufara nekuchinja."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text3"
msgstr "Parizvino, takaita kutsvaga nekukurumidza, rutsigiro rwemutauro rwuri nani, kuronga kwekufanira kuri nani, sarudzo dzakasiyana dzekuronga, uye kusefa pamutauro/rudzi rwebhuku/rudzi rwefaira. Kana uchida kuziva kuti izvi zvinoshanda sei, <a %(annas_archive_l140)s>tarisa</a> <a %(annas_archive_l1115)s>pano</a> <a %(annas_archive_l1635)s></a>. Zviri nyore kuwana, kunyangwe zvingada mamwe makomendi…"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers"
msgstr "300GB+ yemifananidzo yemabhuku yakaburitswa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text1"
msgstr "Pakupedzisira, tiri kufara kuzivisa kuburitswa kudiki. Mukubatana nevanhu vanoshanda neLibgen.rs fork, tiri kugovera mifananidzo yese yemabhuku kuburikidza ne torrents uye IPFS. Izvi zvichagovera mutoro wekuona mifananidzo pakati pemichina yakawanda, uye zvichachengetedza zviri nani. Mune dzakawanda (asi kwete dzese) nyaya, mifananidzo yemabhuku inosanganisirwa mumafaira pachawo, saka izvi zvine mhando ye \"derived data\". Asi kuva nayo muIPFS kuchiri kubatsira pakushanda kwezuva nezuva kweAnna’s Archive uye mapfork akasiyana eLibrary Genesis."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text2"
msgstr "Sezvazvinowanzoitika, unogona kuwana kuburitswa uku kuPirate Library Mirror (EDIT: kwatamiswa ku <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>). Hatizobatanidzi pano, asi unogona kuzviwana nyore."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text3"
msgstr "Tinovimba tinogona kuzorodza kumhanya kwedu zvishoma, zvino tave neimwe nzira yakanaka kuZ-Library. Basa iri harisi kunyanya kugadzikana. Kana uchifarira kubatsira nekodhi, kushanda kwemaseva, kana basa rekuchengetedza, zvirokwazvo taura nesu. Kune zvakawanda <a %(annas_archive)s>zvichiri kuitwa</a>. Ndatenda nekufarira kwako uye nerutsigiro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.signature"
msgstr "- Anna uye timu (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.title"
msgstr "Anna’s Archive yakachengeta yakakura kwazvo comics shadow library pasi rose (95TB) — unogona kubatsira kuiseedha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.tldr"
msgstr "Yakakura kwazvo comic books shadow library pasi rose yaive nepoindi imwechete yekutadza.. kusvika nhasi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.links"
msgstr "<a %(news_ycombinator)s>Kurukura paHacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text1"
msgstr "Yakakura kwazvo shadow library yemabhuku ecomic inenge iri yeimwe Library Genesis fork: Libgen.li. Mumwe mutariri aishanda nesaiti iyoyo akakwanisa kuunganidza muunganidzwa wemacomics unopenga wemafaira anopfuura miriyoni 2, achisvika pamusoro pe95TB. Zvisinei, kusiyana nemamwe maLibrary Genesis collections, iyi yaisawanikwa muhuwandu kuburikidza ne torrents. Iwe waigona chete kuwana macomics aya mumwe nemumwe kuburikidza neserver yake inononoka — poindi imwechete yekutadza. Kusvika nhasi!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text2"
msgstr "Muzvinyorwa ano tichakuudzai zvakawanda nezvekuunganidzwa uku, uye nezvekuunganidzwa kwemari kwedu kutsigira basa iri."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fig1"
msgstr "<q>Dr. Barbara Gordon anoedza kuzvinyudza munyika yezuva nezuva yemaraibhurari…</q>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks"
msgstr "Libgen forks"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text1"
msgstr "Kutanga, kumashure. Unogona kuziva Library Genesis nekuda kwekuunganidzwa kwavo kwemabhuku makuru. Vanhu vashoma vanoziva kuti vashandi veLibrary Genesis vakagadzira mamwe mapurojekiti, akadai sekuunganidzwa kukuru kwemagazini nemagwaro emhando, kuchengetedza kwakazara kweSci-Hub (mukubatana nemuvambi weSci-Hub, Alexandra Elbakyan), uye zvechokwadi, kuunganidzwa kukuru kwemakomiki."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text2"
msgstr "Pane imwe nguva vashandisi vakasiyana veLibrary Genesis mirrors vakaparadzana, izvo zvakapa mamiriro azvino ekuti pave nemaforks akasiyana, ese achiri kutakura zita rekuti Library Genesis. Iyo Libgen.li fork ine kuunganidzwa kwemakomiki uku, pamwe nekuunganidzwa kukuru kwemagazini (kwatinotoshanda zvakare)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration"
msgstr "Kubatana"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text1"
msgstr "Nekuda kwehukuru hwayo, kuunganidzwa uku kwagara kuri pane yedu wishlist, saka mushure mekubudirira kwedu mukuchengetedza Z-Library, takaisa pfungwa dzedu pakuunganidzwa uku. Pakutanga takazvitorera zvakananga, izvo zvaive dambudziko guru, sezvo server yavo yaisava mumamiriro akanaka. Takawana angangoita 15TB nenzira iyi, asi zvaive zvichinonoka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text2"
msgstr "Nerombo rakanaka, takakwanisa kubata nemushandisi weraibhurari, uyo akabvuma kutitumira data rese zvakananga, izvo zvaive nekukurumidza. Zvakatora nguva inopfuura hafu yegore kutamisa nekugadzirisa data rese, uye takapotsa tarasikirwa nazvo zvese nekuda kwekukanganisika kwedhisiki, izvo zvaizoreva kutanga patsva."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text3"
msgstr "Chiitiko ichi chatitenda kuti zvakakosha kuti data iri ibude nekukurumidza sezvinobvira, kuitira kuti igone kutevedzerwa kwese kwese. Tiri kungova nemamiriro ezvinhu asina rombo rakanaka maviri kubva pakurasikirwa nekuunganidzwa uku zvachose!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection"
msgstr "Kuunganidzwa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text1"
msgstr "Kufamba nekukurumidza kunoreva kuti kuunganidzwa uku hakuna kurongeka… Ngatitarisei. Fungidzira tine faira system (iyo muchokwadi tiri kuparadzanisa pamatorrents):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text2"
msgstr "Dhairekitori rekutanga, <code>/repository</code>, ndiyo chikamu chakarongeka cheizvi. Dhairekitori iri rine inonzi “thousand dirs”: madhairekitori ane mafaera chiuru chimwe nechimwe, ayo anoverengwa zvishoma nezvishoma mudhatabhesi. Dhairekitori <code>0</code> rine mafaera ane comic_id 0–999, uye zvichingodaro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text3"
msgstr "Iyi ndiyo nzira imwecheteyo iyo Library Genesis yanga ichishandisa kuunganidzwa kwayo kwemabhuku enhema uye asiri enhema. Pfungwa ndeyekuti yega yega “thousand dir” inozvishandura otomatiki kuita torrent kana yave kuzadzwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text4"
msgstr "Zvisinei, mushandisi weLibgen.li haana kumbogadzira torrents yeiyi kuunganidzwa, uye saka thousand dirs zvichida zvakava zvisina kunaka, uye zvakapa nzira kune “unsorted dirs”. Aya ndiwo <code>/comics0</code> kusvika <code>/comics4</code>. Ese ane zvimiro zvakasiyana-siyana, izvo zvimwe zvaive zvine musoro pakuunganidza mafaera, asi hazvina musoro kwatiri izvozvi. Nerombo rakanaka, metadata ichiri kureva zvakananga kune mafaera ese aya, saka kurongeka kwavo kwekuchengetedza padhisiki hakunei!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text5"
msgstr "Metadata inowanikwa muchimiro cheMySQL database. Izvi zvinogona kutorwa zvakananga kubva paLibgen.li webhusaiti, asi tichazviitawo kuti zviripo mu torrent, pamwe chete netafura yedu yese ine MD5 hashes."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis"
msgstr "Kuongorora"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.text1"
msgstr "Paunowana 95TB yakadururwa muchikwata chako chekuchengetedza, unoedza kunzwisisa kuti chii chiri mukati… Takaita ongororo kuti tione kana taigona kuderedza saizi zvishoma, sekubvisa zvakapetwa. Heano mamwe emhedzisiro yedu:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item1"
msgstr "Zvakapetwa semantic (kusiyana kwekuverenga kwebhuku rimwe chete) zvinogona kubviswa, asi zvinonetsa. Pakuongorora nemaoko makomiki takawana zvakawanda zvisina kunaka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item2"
msgstr "Pane zvimwe zvakapetwa neMD5 chete, izvo zvinopedza, asi kubvisa izvo kungatipa angangoita 1% in kuchengetedza. Pahukuru uhwu izvozvo zvichiri angangoita 1TB, asiwo, pahukuru uhwu 1TB haina basa. Tinosarudza kusatya kuparadza data netsaona mukuita uku."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item3"
msgstr "Takawana data risiri remabhuku, akadai semafirimu akavakirwa pamabhuku emakomiki. Izvozvo zvinoratidzika sekupedza, sezvo izvi zvatove kuwanikwa zvakanyanya nemamwe nzira. Zvisinei, takaziva kuti hatigone kungobvisa mafaera emafirimu, sezvo painewo <em>mabhuku emakomiki anodyidzana</em> akaburitswa pakombiyuta, ayo mumwe munhu akarekodha uye akachengetedza semafirimu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item4"
msgstr "Pakupedzisira, chero chinhu chatingabvisa kubva muunganidzwa chingangoponesa mashoma muzana. Ipapo takarangarira kuti tiri vachengeti vedata, uye vanhu vachange vachimiririra izvi zvakare vachengeti vedata, saka, \"MUNOREVEI, Bvisa?!\" :)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.text2"
msgstr "Naizvozvo tiri kukupai, muunganidzwa uzere, usina kuchinjwa. Iri idata rakawanda, asi tinovimba vanhu vakawanda vachazvifarira kuti varambe vachiritsigira."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser"
msgstr "Fundraiser"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text1"
msgstr "Tiri kuburitsa data iri muzvikamu zvikuru. Torrent yekutanga ndeye <code>/comics0</code>, yatakaisa mufaira rimwe guru 12TB .tar. Izvi zviri nani kune hard drive yako uye torrent software pane mafaira madiki akawanda."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text2"
msgstr "Sechikamu chekuburitswa uku, tiri kuita fundraiser. Tiri kutsvaga kuunganidza $20,000 kuti tivhare mari yekushanda uye yekontrakiti yeunganidzwa uyu, pamwe nekugonesa mapurojekiti aripo uye arikuuya. Tine mamwe <em>makuru</em> arikuuya."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text3"
msgstr "<em>Ndiani wandiri kutsigira nemupiro wangu?</em> Muchidimbu: tiri kuchengetedza ruzivo rwese netsika dzevanhu, uye tichiita kuti zvive nyore kuwanika. Kodhi yedu yese nedata redu zvese zviri open source, tiri purojekiti inomhanyiswa nevanozvipira zvachose, uye tasimudza 125TB yemabhuku kusvika parizvino (pamusoro peLibgen neScihub’s torrents aripo). Pakupedzisira tiri kuvaka flywheel inogonesa uye inokurudzira vanhu kuti vawane, vaongorore, uye vachengetedze mabhuku ese ari munyika. Tichanyora nezvechirongwa chedu chikuru mune ramangwana post. :)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text4"
msgstr "Kana ukapa mari ye12 mwedzi “Amazing Archivist” nhengo ($780), unowana <strong>“kutora torrent”</strong>, zvinoreva kuti tichaisa zita rako remushandisi kana meseji mufaira remumwe we torrent!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text5"
msgstr "Unogona kupa nekushanyira <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a> uye nekudzvanya bhatani rekuti “Donate”. Tiri zvakare kutsvaga vamwe vanozvipira: mainjiniya esoftware, vaongorori vekuchengetedza, nyanzvi dzemabhizimusi asingazivikanwe, uye vashanduri. Unogona zvakare kutitsigira nekupa masevhisi ekugamuchira. Uye zvechokwadi, ndapota rambai muchitsigira torrents dzedu!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text6"
msgstr "Kutenda kune wese akatitsigira nemwoyo wose! Muri kunyatsoita mutsauko."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text7"
msgstr "Heano ma torrents akaburitswa kusvika parizvino (tichiri kugadzirisa mamwe):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text8"
msgstr "Ma torrents ese anogona kuwanikwa pa <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a> pasi pe “Datasets” (hatibatanidzi ipapo zvakananga, saka zvinongedzo kune ino blog hazvibviswi kubva kuReddit, Twitter, nezvimwe). Kubva ipapo, tevera chinongedzo kuwebsite yeTor."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next"
msgstr "Chii chinotevera?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text1"
msgstr "Boka rema torrents rakakura pakuchengetedza kwenguva refu, asi kwete zvakanyanya pakuwanikwa kwezuva nezuva. Tichashanda nevadyidzani vekugamuchira kuti tiise data rese iri pawebhu (sezvo Anna’s Archive isingagamuchire chero chinhu zvakananga). Zvechokwadi unozokwanisa kuwana zvinongedzo izvi zvekurodha paAnna’s Archive."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text2"
msgstr "Tiri kukokawo munhu wese kuti aite zvinhu nedata iri! Tibatsirei kuongorora zviri nani, kudzokorora, kuisa paIPFS, kusanganisa, kudzidzisa mamodheru ako eAI nazvo, nezvimwe. Zvese ndezvako, uye hatikwanise kumirira kuona zvaunoita nazvo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text3"
msgstr "Pakupedzisira, sezvatareva kare, tichine mamwe makuru ekuburitsa arikuuya (kana <em>mumwe munhu</em> aigona <em>netsaona</em> kutitumira dump ye <em>imwe</em> ACS4 database, munoziva kwatinowanikwa…), pamwe nekugadzira flywheel yekuchengetedza mabhuku ese ari munyika."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text4"
msgstr "Saka rambai makatarisa, tichangotanga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.signature"
msgstr "- Anna nechikwata (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.title"
msgstr "3x mabhuku matsva akawedzerwa kuPirate Library Mirror (+24TB, 3.8 miriyoni mabhuku)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text1"
msgstr "Mukuburitswa kwekutanga kwePirate Library Mirror (EDIT: kwatamiswa ku <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>), takaita mirror yeZ-Library, muunganidzwa mukuru wemabhuku asiri pamutemo. Sechiyeuchidzo, izvi ndizvo zvatainyora mune iyo blog post yekutanga:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.q1.text1"
msgstr "Z-Library ibhuku rakakurumbira (uye risiri pamutemo). Vakatora muunganidzwa weLibrary Genesis uye vakaita kuti zvive nyore kutsvaga. Pamusoro pezvo, vave kunyatsoshanda pakukumbira mabhuku matsva, nekukurudzira vashandisi vanopa nemabhenefiti akasiyana. Parizvino havasi kudzosa mabhuku matsva aya kuLibrary Genesis. Uye kusiyana neLibrary Genesis, havasi kuita kuti muunganidzwa wavo uve nyore ku mirror, izvo zvinodzivirira kuchengetedzwa kwakapararira. Izvi zvakakosha kumodheru yavo yebhizinesi, sezvo vachibhadharisa mari yekuwana muunganidzwa wavo muhuwandu (kupfuura mabhuku gumi pazuva)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.q1.text2"
msgstr "Hatidi kuita zvirevo zvemaitiro pamusoro pekubhadharisa mari yekuwana mabhuku asiri pamutemo. Hazvina mubvunzo kuti Z-Library yakabudirira mukuwedzera kuwanikwa kweruzivo, uye kuwana mamwe mabhuku. Isu tiri pano chete kuita chikamu chedu: kuona kuchengetedzwa kwenguva refu kwekuunganidzwa uku kwega."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text2"
msgstr "Kuunganidzwa uku kwakadzokera pakati pa2021. Zvichakadaro, Z-Library yakakura nekukurumidza: vakawedzera mabhuku matsva angangoita 3.8 miriyoni. Pane dzimwe dzinodzokororwa imomo, hongu, asi ruzhinji rwacho runoratidzika kunge mabhuku matsva, kana kuti kuongororwa kwemhando yepamusoro kwemabhuku akambotumirwa. Izvi zvinonyanya kukonzerwa nekuwedzera kwevashandi vekuzvipira kuZ-Library, uye hurongwa hwavo hwekuisa mabhuku akawanda nekudzokorora. Tinoda kuvakwazisa pamabasa aya."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text3"
msgstr "Tinofara kuzivisa kuti tawana mabhuku ese akawedzerwa kuZ-Library pakati pemirazi yedu yapfuura naAugust 2022. Takadzokera zvakare tikatora mamwe mabhuku atakanga tapotsa pakutanga. Zvese zvese, kuunganidzwa kutsva uku kuri angangoita 24TB, izvo zvakakura kupfuura yapfuura (7TB). Mirazi yedu yave 31TB yose. Zvakare, takadzokorora neLibrary Genesis, sezvo pane matorrent aripo ekuunganidzwa ikoko."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text4"
msgstr "Ndapota enda kuPirate Library Mirror kuti uone kuunganidzwa kutsva (EDIT: kwatamiswa ku <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>). Pane rumwe ruzivo ipapo pamusoro pekuti mafaera akarongeka sei, uye chii chachinja kubva pakupedzisira. Hatizobatanidzi ipapo kubva pano, sezvo iri ingori webhusaiti yeblog isingagari zvinhu zvisiri pamutemo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text5"
msgstr "Ehe, kuseedha zvakare inzira huru yekutibatsira. Tinotenda munhu wese ari kuseedha seti yedu yapfuura yematorrent. Tinotenda nekupindura kwakanaka, uye tinofara kuti kune vanhu vakawanda vanokoshesa kuchengetedzwa kweruzivo netsika nenzira iyi isina kujairika."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.signature"
msgstr "- Anna uye timu (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.title"
msgstr "Maitiro ekuzova pirate archivist"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.tldr"
msgstr "Dambudziko rekutanga rinogona kushamisa. Harisi dambudziko rehunyanzvi, kana dambudziko repamutemo. Iri idambudziko repfungwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates"
msgstr "Tisati tapinda mukati, pane zvigadziriso zviviri paPirate Library Mirror (EDIT: kwatamiswa ku <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates.item1"
msgstr "Takawana mipiro yakakura zvikuru. Yekutanga yaive $10k kubva kumunhu asina kuzivikanwa uyo zvakare anga achitsigira \"bookwarrior\", muvambi wekutanga weLibrary Genesis. Kutenda kwakakosha kuna bookwarrior nekufambisa mipiro iyi. Yechipiri yaive imwe $10k kubva kumupi asina kuzivikanwa, uyo akatibata mushure mekuburitswa kwedu kwekupedzisira, uye akafemerwa kubatsira. Takavewo nenhamba yemipiro midiki. Kutenda zvikuru nerutsigiro rwenyu rwemwoyo murefu. Tine mamwe mapurojekiti matsva anofadza ari mupombi ayo izvi zvichatsigira, saka rambai makatarira."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates.item2"
msgstr "Takave nedambudziko rehunyanzvi nehukuru hwekuburitswa kwedu kwechipiri, asi matorrent edu ave kumusoro uye ari kuseedha izvozvi. Takawana zvakare chipo chikuru kubva kumunhu asina kuzivikanwa kuti aseedhe kuunganidzwa kwedu pamaseva avo ane kumhanya kwakanyanya, saka tiri kuita kurodha kwakakosha kumichina yavo, mushure mezvo vamwe vese vari kurodha kuunganidzwa vanofanira kuona kuvandudzwa kukuru mukumhanya."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text1"
msgstr "Mabhuku akazara anogona kunyorwa pamusoro pe <em>nei</em> kwekuchengetedza kwedhijitari kazhinji, uye pirate archivism kunyanya, asi ngatipa pfupiso inokurumidza kune avo vasina kujairana. Nyika iri kugadzira ruzivo netsika zvakawanda kupfuura nakare kose, asi zvakare zvakawanda zvacho zviri kurasika kupfuura nakare kose. Vanhu vakawanda vanovimba nemakambani akaita sevaparidzi vezvidzidzo, masevhisi ekutepfenyura, uye makambani enhau dzezvemagariro neiyi nhaka, uye havana kazhinji kuratidza kuva vachengeti vakuru. Tarisa chinyorwa cheDigital Amnesia, kana chero hurukuro naJason Scott."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text2"
msgstr "Pane mamwe masangano anoita basa rakanaka rekuchengetedza zvakawanda sezvavanogona, asi vanosungirwa nemutemo. Semapirate, tiri munzvimbo yakasarudzika yekuchengetedza kuunganidzwa kwavasingagone kubata, nekuda kwekumanikidzwa kwekodzero kana zvimwe zvirambidzo. Tinogonawo kutevedzera kuunganidzwa kakawanda, pasi rose, nokudaro tichiwedzera mikana yekuchengetedzwa kwakakodzera."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text3"
msgstr "Parizvino, hatizopindi mumakakatanwa pamusoro pezvakanakira nezvakaipira pfuma yehungwaru, maitiro ekutyora mutemo, kufungisisa pamusoro pekudzvinyirira, kana nyaya yekuwana ruzivo netsika. Nemaitiro ese aya akabviswa, ngatipinde mu <em>maitiro</em>. Tichagovera kuti timu yedu yakava sei mapirate archivists, uye zvidzidzo zvatakadzidza panzira. Pane zvakawanda zvinetso paunotanga rwendo urwu, uye tinovimba tinogona kukubatsira kuburikidza nezvimwe zvacho."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community"
msgstr "Nharaunda"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text1"
msgstr "Dambudziko rekutanga rinogona kushamisa. Harisi dambudziko rehunyanzvi, kana dambudziko repamutemo. Iri idambudziko repfungwa: kuita basa iri mumumvuri kunogona kuva kwekusurukirwa zvikuru. Zvichienderana nezvauri kuronga kuita, uye modhi yako yekutyisidzirwa, unogona kunge uchifanira kungwarira zvikuru. Kune rimwe divi remuchinjikwa tine vanhu vakaita saAlexandra Elbakyan*, muvambi weSci-Hub, uyo akavhurika zvikuru nezve zviitiko zvake. Asi ari panjodzi huru yekusungwa kana akashanyira nyika dzekumadokero panguva ino, uye anogona kutarisana nemakore emakore mujeri. Icho chingave njodzi yaungade kutora here? Tiri kune rimwe divi remuchinjikwa; tichingwarira kwazvo kuti tisarege chero tsoka, uye tine kuchengetedzwa kwakasimba kwekushanda."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text2"
msgstr "* Sezvambotaurwa paHN na \"ynno\", pakutanga Alexandra aisada kuzivikanwa: \"Maseva ake akanga akagadzirirwa kuburitsa mharidzo dzakadzama dzemhosho kubva kuPHP, kusanganisira nzira yakazara yefaira riri kukanganisa, iyo yaive pasi pedhairekitori /home/ringo-ring, iyo yaigona kuteverwa kune zita remushandisi raakanga aine online pane saiti isina hukama, yakabatanidzwa kuzita rake chairo. Pamberi pekuziviswa uku, aive asina kuzivikanwa.\" Saka, shandisa mazita emushandisi asina kujairika pamakomputa aunoshandisa pazvinhu izvi, kana ukagadzirisa chimwe chinhu zvisirizvo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text3"
msgstr "Kuvanzika uku, zvisinei, kunouya nemutengo wepfungwa. Vanhu vazhinji vanoda kuzivikanwa nebasa ravanorita, uye zvakadaro haugone kutora chero mbiri yeizvi muhupenyu chaihwo. Kunyange zvinhu zviri nyore zvinogona kuva zvinonetsa, sekubvunzwa neshamwari kuti wanga uri kuita chii (pane imwe nguva \"kugadzirisa NAS yangu / homelab\" kunonetsa)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text4"
msgstr "Ndicho chikonzero nei zvakakosha kuwana imwe nharaunda. Unogona kurega imwe kuchengetedzwa kwekushanda nekureurura kune dzimwe shamwari dzepedyo, dzaunoziva kuti unogona kuvimba nadzo zvakadzama. Kunyange zvakadaro chenjera kuti usaisa chero chinhu mukunyora, kana vachifanira kupa maemail avo kuzviremera, kana kana michina yavo yakanganiswa nenzira ipi zvayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text5"
msgstr "Zvirinani kuwana vamwe mapirate. Kana shamwari dzako dzepedyo dzichifarira kujoinha iwe, zvakanaka! Zvikasadaro, unogona kukwanisa kuwana vamwe online. Zvinosuruvarisa kuti ichi chiri chinyararire chinyararire. Kusvikira zvino tawana vamwe vashoma chete vari kushanda munzvimbo iyi. Nzvimbo dzakanaka dzekutanga dzinoratidzika kunge dziri maforamu eLibrary Genesis, uye r/DataHoarder. Chikwata cheArchive chinewo vanhu vane pfungwa dzakafanana, kunyangwe vachishanda mukati memutemo (kunyangwe mune dzimwe nzvimbo dzemutemo dzine grey). Nzvimbo dzechinyakare \"warez\" uye dzehupirate dzinewo vanhu vanofunga nenzira dzakafanana."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text6"
msgstr "Tiri kuvhurika kumazano ekuti tikurudzire nharaunda uye kuongorora mazano. Inzwa wakasununguka kutitumira meseji paTwitter kana Reddit. Pamwe tingagone kuitisa rudzi rweforamu kana boka rekutaura. Dambudziko rimwe nderekuti izvi zvinogona kunyatso censored kana tichishandisa mapuratifomu akajairika, saka tinofanira kuzvitambira isu pachedu. Pane zvakare kuchinjanisa pakati pekuita hurukuro idzi dzive pachena zvizere (kuwedzera mukana wekubatana) kana kuti kuidzivirira (kusatendera \"vavariro\" kuti vazive kuti tiri kuda kuvabvuta). Tichafunga nezvazvo. Tizivise kana uchifarira izvi!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects"
msgstr "Mapurojekiti"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.text1"
msgstr "Kana tichiita purojekiti, ine nhanho dzinoverengeka:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase1"
msgstr "Kusarudza nzvimbo / uzivi: Unoda kutarisa papi, uye nei? Ndezvipi zvaunofarira, hunyanzvi, uye mamiriro akasiyana aunogona kushandisa kubatsira kwako?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase2"
msgstr "Kusarudza chinangwa: Ndeipi chaiyo muunganidzwa yaunoda kutevedzera?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase3"
msgstr "Metadata scraping: Kuunganidza ruzivo nezve mafaera, pasina kunyatso dhawunirodha mafaera (anowanzove makuru) pachawo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase4"
msgstr "Kusarudza data: Zvichienderana nemetadata, kuderedza kuti ndeipi data yakakosha kuchengetedza izvozvi. Zvingave zvese, asi kazhinji pane nzira inonzwisisika yekuchengetedza nzvimbo uye bandwidth."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase5"
msgstr "Data scraping: Kunyatso tora data."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase6"
msgstr "Kugovera: Kurongedza mumatirenti, kuzivisa kune imwe nzvimbo, kuita kuti vanhu vaiparadzirire."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.text2"
msgstr "Idzi hadzisi nhanho dzakazvimirira zvachose, uye kazhinji nzwisiso kubva pane imwe nhanho inodzosa kune imwe nhanho yapfuura. Semuenzaniso, panguva yekutora metadata unogona kuona kuti chinangwa chawakasarudza chine nzira dzekudzivirira dzinopfuura hunyanzvi hwako (senge IP blocks), saka unodzokera kumashure uye unotsvaga chimwe chinangwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain"
msgstr "1. Kusarudza nzvimbo / uzivi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text1"
msgstr "Hakuna kushomeka kweruzivo uye nhaka yetsika yekuchengetedza, izvo zvinogona kuvhiringidza. Ndokusaka zvichiwanzobatsira kutora nguva uye kufunga nezve chipo chako chingave chii."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text2"
msgstr "Munhu wese ane nzira yakasiyana yekufunga nezvazvo, asi heano mamwe mibvunzo yaungazvibvunza:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.why"
msgstr "Nei uchifarira izvi? Chii chaunofarira? Kana tikakwanisa kuwana boka revanhu vanotevedzera mhando yezvinhu zvavanonyanya kufarira, izvo zvingafukidza zvakawanda! Uchaziva zvakawanda kupfuura munhu wepakati nezve chido chako, senge chii chakakosha data kuchengetedza, ndezvipi zvakanakisa muunganidzwa uye nharaunda dzepamhepo, uye zvichingodaro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.skills"
msgstr "Ndeapi hunyanzvi aunawo aunogona kushandisa kubatsira kwako? Semuenzaniso, kana uri nyanzvi yekuchengetedza pamhepo, unogona kuwana nzira dzekukunda IP blocks kune zvinangwa zvakachengeteka. Kana uri kugona kuronga nharaunda, ipapo pamwe unogona kuunganidza vamwe vanhu pamwe chete kutenderedza chinangwa. Zvinobatsira kuziva imwe programming zvakadaro, kana kungova nekuchengetedzeka kwakanaka kwekushanda mukati meichi chiitiko."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.time"
msgstr "Une nguva yakadii yekuita izvi? Zano redu nderekutanga zvishoma uye kuita mapurojekiti makuru sezvaunowana ruzivo, asi zvinogona kutora nguva yakawanda."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.target"
msgstr "Ndeipi nzvimbo ine simba rekutarisa? Kana uchizopedza maawa X pakuchengetedza zvisiri pamutemo, ipapo unogona kuwana sei \"bang for your buck\" yakakura?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.thinking"
msgstr "Ndeipi nzira dzakasiyana dzauri kufunga nezvazvo? Unogona kunge uine mamwe mazano anonakidza kana nzira dzimwe dzingave dzisina kuona."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text3"
msgstr "Panyaya yedu, takafarira kuchengetedzwa kwenguva refu kwesainzi. Takaziva nezve Library Genesis, uye kuti yakanga yakazara zvakazara kakawanda uchishandisa matirenti. Takada pfungwa iyoyo. Zvino rimwe zuva, mumwe wedu akaedza kutsvaga mamwe mabhuku esainzi paLibrary Genesis, asi haana kuwana, zvichiunza mukupokana kuti yakazara sei chaizvo. Takabva tatsvaga mabhuku iwayo pamhepo, tikawana mune dzimwe nzvimbo, izvo zvakadyara mbeu yepurojekiti yedu. Kunyange tisati taziva nezve Z-Library, takanga tine pfungwa yekusazama kuunganidza mabhuku ese aya nemaoko, asi kutarisa pakutevedzera muunganidzwa uripo, uye kuapa zvakare kuLibrary Genesis."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target"
msgstr "2. Kusarudza chinangwa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text1"
msgstr "Saka, tine nzvimbo yedu yatiri kutarisa, zvino ndeipi chaiyo muunganidzwa yatinofanira kutevedzera? Pane zvinhu zvishoma zvinoita kuti ive yakanaka:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.large"
msgstr "Huru"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.unique"
msgstr "Yakasiyana: isati yambofukidzwa nemamwe mapurojekiti."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.accessible"
msgstr "Inowanikwa: haishandisi matanho mazhinji ekudzivirira kuti ikudzivise kubva pakukweva metadata yavo uye data."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.insight"
msgstr "Nzwisiso yakakosha: une rumwe ruzivo rwakakosha nezve iyi target, sekunge une mukana wakakosha kuunganidzwa uku, kana kuti wakawana nzira yekukunda dziviriro yavo. Izvi hazvidiwi (purojekiti yedu inouya haizoiti chero chinhu chakakosha), asi zvinobatsira!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text2"
msgstr "Patakawana mabhuku edu esainzi pawebhusaiti dzisiri Library Genesis, takaedza kuona kuti akasvika sei paindaneti. Takazowana Z-Library, uye takaona kuti kunyangwe mabhuku mazhinji asingatangi kuoneka ipapo, anopedzisira asvika ipapo. Takadzidza nezvehukama hwayo neLibrary Genesis, uye chimiro chemari uye mushandisi interface yakanakisa, zvese izvi zvakaita kuti ive muunganidzwa wakakwana. Takazobva taita metadata yekutanga uye data scraping, uye takaona kuti taigona kupfuura miganho yavo yeIP download, tichishandisa imwe nhengo yedu yakakosha kuwana kune akawanda proxy servers."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text3"
msgstr "Paunenge uchiongorora zvakasiyana-siyana, zvakakosha kare kuviga nzira dzako nekushandisa maVPN uye kero dzeemail dzinoraswa, izvo zvatichataura nezvazvo zvakadzama gare gare."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata"
msgstr "3. Metadata scraping"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text1"
msgstr "Ngatipindei mune zvimwe zvehunyanzvi pano. Kuti tikweve metadata kubva kumawebhusaiti, takachengeta zvinhu zviri nyore. Tinoshandisa Python scripts, dzimwe nguva curl, uye MySQL database kuchengetedza mhedzisiro. Hatina kushandisa chero software yekukweva inonakidza inogona kumepu mawebhusaiti akaoma, sezvo kusvika parizvino taingoda kukweva imwe kana mbiri mhando dzemapeji nekungoverenga kuburikidza neids uye kuongorora HTML. Kana pasina mapeji anoverengeka nyore, unogona kuda crawler chaiyo inoyedza kutsvaga mapeji ese."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text2"
msgstr "Usati watanga kukweva webhusaiti yese, edza kuzviita nemaoko kwechinguva. Pfuura nemapeji akati wandei iwe pachako, kuti unzwisise kuti izvi zvinoshanda sei. Dzimwe nguva unotozomhanyira mukuvharwa kweIP kana imwe maitiro anofadza nenzira iyi. Izvo zvakafanana kune data scraping: usati wapinda zvakanyanya mune iyi target, ita shuwa kuti unogona kunyatso dhawunirodha data yayo zvinobudirira."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text3"
msgstr "Kuti upfuure nemiganho, pane zvinhu zvishoma zvaunogona kuedza. Pane dzimwe kero dzeIP kana maseva anogamuchira data rimwe chete asi asina miganho imwechete here? Pane chero API endpoints isina miganho, nepo dzimwe dzine? Paunenge uchidhawunirodha, IP yako inovharwa here, uye kwenguva yakareba sei? Kana kuti hausi kuvharwa asi unoderedzwa here? Kana ukagadzira account yemushandisi, zvinhu zvinobva zvachinja sei? Unogona kushandisa HTTP/2 kuchengetedza kubatana kuvhurika, uye izvo zvinowedzera here mwero waunogona kukumbira mapeji? Pane mapeji anonyora mafaera akawanda kamwechete, uye ruzivo rwunonyorwa ipapo rwakakwana here?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text4"
msgstr "Zvinhu zvaungade kuchengetedza zvinosanganisira:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.title"
msgstr "Zita"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.location"
msgstr "Zita refaira / nzvimbo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.id"
msgstr "ID: inogona kunge iri imwe ID yemukati, asi maID akaita seISBN kana DOI anobatsira zvakare."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.size"
msgstr "Saizi: kuverenga kuti unoda nzvimbo yakadii yediski."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.hash"
msgstr "Hash (md5, sha1): kusimbisa kuti wakadhawunirodha faira nemazvo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.dates"
msgstr "Zuva rakawedzerwa/rakashandurwa: kuti ugone kudzoka gare gare uye dhawunirodha mafaera ausina kudhawunirodha kare (kunyangwe iwe unogona kazhinji kushandisa ID kana hash kune izvi)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.notes"
msgstr "Tsananguro, chikamu, matagi, vanyori, mutauro, nezvimwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text5"
msgstr "Kazhinji tinoita izvi mumatanho maviri. Kutanga tinodhawunirodha mafaera eHTML asina kuchinjwa, kazhinji zvakananga muMySQL (kuti tirege kuwanda kwemafaira madiki, izvo zvatinotaura nezvazvo zvakadzama pazasi). Zvadaro, mune imwe nhanho yakaparadzana, tinopfuura nemumafaira eHTML aya uye toavhura kuita matafura chaiwo eMySQL. Nenzira iyi haufanirwe kudzorerazve zvese kubva pakutanga kana ukawana kukanganisa mukodhi yako yekuvhura, sezvo uchingogona kugadzirisa mafaera eHTML nekodhi itsva. Zvakare kazhinji zviri nyore kupatsanura nhanho yekugadzirisa, nekudaro kuchengetedza imwe nguva (uye unogona kunyora kodhi yekugadzirisa apo kukweva kuri kumhanya, pane kuti unyore matanho ese ari maviri panguva imwe chete)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text6"
msgstr "Pakupedzisira, cherechedzai kuti kune dzimwe nzvimbo metadata scraping ndiyo chete iripo. Pane dzimwe hombe metadata collections kunze uko dzisina kuchengetedzwa nemazvo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data"
msgstr "4. Kusarudza Dhata"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text1"
msgstr "Kazhinji unogona kushandisa metadata kuti uwane chikamu chakakodzera chedhata kuti udhaunirodhe. Kunyangwe ukazoda kudhaunirodha dhata rese, zvinogona kubatsira kutanga nezvinhu zvakakosha, kana ukazowanikwa uye kudzivirirwa kwakagadziridzwa, kana nekuti ungangoda kutenga mamwe ma disks, kana nekuti chimwe chinhu chinogona kuitika muhupenyu hwako usati wadhawunirodha zvese."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text2"
msgstr "Semuyenzaniso, muunganidzwa unogona kunge uine shanduro dzakawanda dzechinhu chimwe chete (senge bhuku kana firimu), uko imwe inoratidzwa seyemhando yepamusoro. Kuchengetedza shanduro idzodzo kutanga kunonzwisisika. Unogona kuzoda kuchengetedza shanduro dzese, sezvo mune dzimwe nguva metadata inogona kunge yakanyorwa zvisirizvo, kana kuti panogona kunge paine kusiyana kusingazivikanwe pakati peshanduro (semuenzaniso, \"shanduro yakanakisa\" inogona kunge iri yakanakisa munzira zhinji asi isina kunaka mune dzimwe nzira, senge firimu rine resolution yepamusoro asi risina zvinyorwa)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text3"
msgstr "Unogonawo kutsvaga mudhatabhesi yako yemetadata kuti uwane zvinhu zvinonakidza. Ndeipi faira hombe inogamuchirwa, uye nei yakakura kudaro? Ndeipi faira diki? Pane mapatani anonakidza kana asingatarisirwi kana zvasvika kune mamwe mapoka, mitauro, nezvimwewo here? Pane mazita akapetana kana akafanana zvakanyanya here? Pane mapatani ekuti dhata rakawedzerwa riini, senge rimwe zuva apo mafaera mazhinji akawedzerwa kamwechete here? Unogona kazhinji kudzidza zvakawanda nekutarisa dhataseti nenzira dzakasiyana."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text4"
msgstr "Munyaya yedu, takabvisa mabhuku eZ-Library tichishandisa md5 hashes muLibrary Genesis, nekudaro tichichengetedza nguva yakawanda yekudhaunirodha uye nzvimbo yediski. Iyi inyaya yakasarudzika zvakanyanya zvakadaro. Muzviitiko zvakawanda hapana dhatabhesi dzakazara dze mafaira atove akachengetedzwa nemazvo nevamwe vapambi. Izvi pachazvo mukana mukuru kune mumwe munhu kunze uko. Zvingave zvakanaka kuve neongororo inogara ichivandudzwa yezvinhu zvakaita semimhanzi nemafirimu atove akapararira zvakanyanya pamatorrent websites, uye nekudaro zviri pasi pekutanga kuisanganisira mumapirate mirrors."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping"
msgstr "5. Kuunganidza Dhata"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text1"
msgstr "Iye zvino wagadzirira chaizvo kudhaunirodha dhata rakawanda. Sezvambotaurwa, panguva ino unofanirwa kunge watodhawnurodha mafaera akati wandei nemaoko, kuti unzwisise zviri nani maitiro uye zvirambidzo zvechinangwa. Zvisinei, pachave nezvinoshamisa zvichakumirira kana wava kudhaunirodha mafaera mazhinji kamwechete."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text2"
msgstr "Mazano edu pano ndeekuchengetedza zvinhu zviri nyore. Tanga nekungodhaunirodha mafaera akati wandei. Unogona kushandisa Python, uyezve kuwedzera kune akawanda threads. Asi dzimwe nguva kunyange zviri nyore ndezvekugadzira Bash mafaera zvakananga kubva mudhatabhesi, uyezve kumhanya akawanda awo mumahwindo akawanda eterminal kuti uwedzere. Rimwe dambudziko rehutano rinokosha kutaura pano nderekushandisa OUTFILE muMySQL, iyo yaunogona kunyora chero kupi kana ukaremadza \"secure_file_priv\" mu mysqld.cnf (uye iva nechokwadi chekumisawo/kupfuura AppArmor kana uri paLinux)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text3"
msgstr "Isu tinochengeta dhata pamahard disks akareruka. Tanga nezvaunazvo, uye wedzera zvishoma nezvishoma. Zvinogona kuvhundutsa kufunga nezvekuchengetedza mazana eTBs edhata. Kana iri iyo mamiriro auri kusangana nawo, ingoisa chikamu chakanaka kutanga, uye muchiziviso chako kumbira rubatsiro mukuchengetedza zvimwe. Kana uchida kuwana mamwe ma hard drives iwe pachako, ipapo r/DataHoarder ine zvimwe zviwanikwa zvakanaka pakuwana zvibvumirano zvakanaka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text4"
msgstr "Edza kusanyanya kunetseka nezve mafayilesystem anoyevedza. Zviri nyore kupinda mugomba regonzo rekumisikidza zvinhu zvakaita seZFS. Imwe nhoroondo yehunyanzvi yekuziva zvakadaro, ndeyekuti mafayilesystem mazhinji haashande zvakanaka nemafaera mazhinji. Takawana kuti imwe nzira iri nyore ndeyekugadzira madhairekitori akawanda, semuenzaniso kune akasiyana ID ranges kana hash prefixes."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text5"
msgstr "Mushure mekudhaunirodha dhata, iva nechokwadi chekuongorora kutendeka kwemafaera uchishandisa hashes mumetadata, kana iripo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution"
msgstr "6. Kugovera"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text1"
msgstr "Une dhata, nekudaro uchikupa iwe muridzi wepirate mirror wekutanga wechinangwa chako (zvinogona). Munzira dzakawanda chikamu chakaoma chapera, asi chikamu chine njodzi chiri pamberi pako. Mushure mezvose, kusvika parizvino wanga uri muchivande; uchibhururuka pasi pe radar. Zvese zvaunofanirwa kuita kwaive kushandisa VPN yakanaka nguva dzese, kusazadza ruzivo rwako pachako mumafomu chero api (duh), uye pamwe kushandisa chikamu chakakosha chebrowser (kana kunyange komputa yakasiyana)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text2"
msgstr "Iye zvino unofanirwa kugovera dhata. Munyaya yedu takatanga kuda kupa mabhuku kuLibrary Genesis, asi takabva tawana matambudziko mukuita izvozvo (kuronga ngano vs zvisiri ngano). Saka takasarudza kugovera tichishandisa Library Genesis-style torrents. Kana uine mukana wekupa kune chirongwa chiripo, ipapo izvo zvinogona kukuchengetera nguva yakawanda. Zvisinei, hapana ma pirate mirrors akarongeka zvakanaka kunze uko parizvino."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text3"
msgstr "Saka ngatitii wasarudza kugovera torrents iwe pachako. Edza kuchengetedza mafaera iwayo madiki, kuitira kuti zvive nyore kumiririra pane mamwe mawebhusaiti. Iwe unozofanirwa kuzviberekesa iwe pachako, uchiri kuramba wakavanzika. Unogona kushandisa VPN (ine kana isina port forwarding), kana kubhadhara ne tumbled Bitcoins yeSeedbox. Kana usingazive zvimwe zvezvirevo izvi zvinoreva, uchave neboka rekudzidza kuita, sezvo zvakakosha kuti unzwisise njodzi dziripo pano."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text4"
msgstr "Unogona kugamuchira mafaera etorrent pachawo pamatorrent websites aripo. Munyaya yedu, takasarudza kugamuchira webhusaiti, sezvo taidawo kuparadzira uzivi hwedu nenzira yakajeka. Unogona kuzviita iwe pachako nenzira yakafanana (tinoshandisa Njalla kumadomains edu uye kugamuchira, kubhadharwa ne tumbled Bitcoins), asi zvakare inzwa wakasununguka kutibata kuti tigamuchire ma torrents ako. Tiri kutsvaga kuvaka index yakazara yemapirate mirrors nekufamba kwenguva, kana pfungwa iyi ikabatikana."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text5"
msgstr "Kana zvasvika pakusarudza VPN, zvakawanda zvakanyorwa nezvazvo kare, saka tichangodzokorora zano rakajairika rekusarudza nemukurumbira. Zvirongwa zvechokwadi zvakaedzwa mudare zvisina log policies nemarekodhi akareba ekudzivirira zvakavanzika ndiyo sarudzo ine njodzi shoma, mumaonero edu. Cherechedzai kuti kunyangwe kana muchiita zvese nemazvo, hamugone kusvika panjodzi zero. Semuenzaniso, kana muchiberekesa ma torrents enyu, mutambi wenyika unokurudzirwa zvikuru anogona kutarisa kuyerera kwedata kunouya nekubuda kweVPN servers, uye kuona kuti ndimi ani. Kana kuti unogona kungokanganisa neimwe nzira. Isu tingangodaro takatotadza, uye tichazotadza zvakare. Nerombo rakanaka, nyika hadzinei <em>zvakanyanya</em> nezve piracy."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text6"
msgstr "Imwe sarudzo yekuita kune rimwe nerimwe chirongwa, ndeyekuti riburitswe richishandisa zita rimwechete sekupera, kana kwete. Kana ukaramba uchishandisa zita rimwe chete, ipapo zvikanganiso mukuchengetedzwa kwekushanda kubva kumapurojekiti apfuura zvinogona kudzoka kuzokuruma. Asi kuburitsa pasi pemazita akasiyana zvinoreva kuti hauvake mukurumbira unogara kwenguva refu. Isu takasarudza kuva nekuchengetedzwa kwekushanda kwakasimba kubva pakutanga kuti tikwanise kuramba tichishandisa zita rimwe chete, asi hatizoregi kuburitsa pasi pezita rakasiyana kana tikakanganisa kana kana mamiriro ezvinhu achida izvozvo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text7"
msgstr "Kusvitsa shoko kunogona kunetsa. Sezvatareva, ichi chiri chinyorwa chisingawanzo. Pakutanga takatumira paReddit, asi takawana kubudirira paHacker News. Parizvino kurudziro yedu ndeyekuipost munzvimbo shoma uye kuona zvinoitika. Uye zvakare, taura nesu. Tichafarira kuparadzira shoko remamwe mapirate archivism kuedza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.conclusion"
msgstr "Mhedziso"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.conclusion.text1"
msgstr "Tinovimba kuti izvi zvinobatsira kune avo vanotanga kuva vachengeti veanopamba mabhuku. Tiri kufara kukugamuchirai munyika ino, saka musazeze kutibata. Ngatichengetedzei ruzivo uye tsika dzepasi rose sezvatinogona, uye ngatizvifambisei kure nekure."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.signature"
msgstr "- Anna uye timu (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.title"
msgstr "Kusuma Pirate Library Mirror: Kuchengetedza 7TB yemabhuku (asiri muLibgen)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text1"
msgstr "Projekiti iyi (EDIT: yachinjwa ku <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>) ine chinangwa chekubatsira mukuchengetedza uye kusunungura ruzivo rwevanhu. Tinoita mupiro wedu mudiki uye wakaderera, tichitevera tsoka dzevakuru vasati vedu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text2"
msgstr "Chinangwa cheprojekiti iyi chinoratidzwa nezita rayo:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.pirate"
msgstr "<strong>Pirate</strong> - Tinotyora mutemo wekodzero munyika zhinji nemaune. Izvi zvinotibvumira kuita chimwe chinhu icho masangano epamutemo asingakwanise kuita: kuona kuti mabhuku anofambiswa kure nekure."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.library"
msgstr "<strong>Library</strong> - Kufanana nemaraibhurari mazhinji, tinonyanya kutarisa pazvinhu zvakanyorwa semabhuku. Tinogona kuwedzera kune dzimwe mhando dzezvinyorwa mune ramangwana."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.mirror"
msgstr "<strong>Mirror</strong> - Isu tiri chete girazi remaraibhurari aripo. Tinotarisa pakuchengetedza, kwete pakuita kuti mabhuku awanikwe nyore nyore uye adhawnodhode (kuwana) kana kukurudzira nharaunda huru yevanhu vanopa mabhuku matsva (kuwana)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text3"
msgstr "Raibhurari yekutanga yatakagadzira girazi ndeye Z-Library. Iyi ndiyo raibhurari inozivikanwa (uye isiri pamutemo). Vakatora muunganidzwa weLibrary Genesis uye vakaita kuti uwanikwe nyore nyore. Pamusoro pezvo, vave kunyatsoshanda pakukumbira mabhuku matsva, nekukurudzira vashandisi vanopa nemabhenefiti akasiyana. Parizvino havasi kupa mabhuku matsva aya kuLibrary Genesis. Uye kusiyana neLibrary Genesis, havasi kuita kuti muunganidzwa wavo uwanikwe nyore nyore, izvo zvinodzivirira kuchengetedzwa kwakapararira. Izvi zvakakosha kumodhi yavo yebhizinesi, sezvo vachibhadharisa mari yekuwana muunganidzwa wavo muhuwandu (kupfuura mabhuku gumi pazuva)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text4"
msgstr "Hatidi kuita zvirevo zvemaitiro pamusoro pekubhadharisa mari yekuwana mabhuku asiri pamutemo. Hazvina mubvunzo kuti Z-Library yakabudirira mukuwedzera kuwanikwa kweruzivo, uye kuwana mamwe mabhuku. Isu tiri pano chete kuita chikamu chedu: kuona kuchengetedzwa kwenguva refu kwekuunganidzwa uku kwega."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text5"
msgstr "Tinoda kukukumbirai kuti mubatsire kuchengetedza uye kusunungura ruzivo rwevanhu nekudhawunirodha uye kuseedha ma torrents edu. Ona peji reprojekiti kuti uwane rumwe ruzivo nezvekuti data rakarongeka sei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text6"
msgstr "Tinodawo zvikuru kukukumbirai kuti mupe pfungwa dzenyu dzekuti ndeapi muunganidzwa anotevera ekugadzira girazi, uye kuti tingaita sei. Pamwe chete tinogona kuzadzisa zvakawanda. Ichi chingori chipo chidiki pakati pezvimwe zvakawanda. Tinotenda, nezvose zvamunoita."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.signature"
msgstr "- Anna uye timu (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.footnote"
msgstr "<em>Hatibatanidzi mafaira kubva kubhurogi rino. Ndapota zviwanirei.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.title"
msgstr "ISBNdb dump, kana Mabhuku Mangani Anogara Akachengetedzwa?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.tldr"
msgstr "Kana taizobvisa zvakapetwa mafaira kubva kumaraibhurari emumvuri, chii chingave chikamu chemabhuku ese epasi rose atakachengetedza?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text1"
msgstr "NePirate Library Mirror (EDIT: yachinjwa ku <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>), chinangwa chedu ndechekutora mabhuku ese epasi rose, uye kuachengetedza nekusingaperi.<sup>1</sup> Pakati peZ-Library torrents yedu, uye ma torrents ekutanga eLibrary Genesis, tine mafaira 11,783,153. Asi mangani acho, chaizvo? Kana taizobvisa zvakapetwa mafaira aya, chii chingave chikamu chemabhuku ese epasi rose atakachengetedza? Tinoda chaizvo kuva nechinhu chakadai:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.10%"
msgstr "10% of nhaka yakanyorwa yevanhu yakachengetedzwa nekusingaperi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text2"
msgstr "Kuti tiwane chikamu, tinoda denominator: huwandu hwemabhuku ese akambobudiswa.<sup>2</sup> Pamberi pekupera kweGoogle Books, injiniya pachirongwa ichi, Leonid Taycher, <a %(booksearch_blogspot)s>akaedza kufungidzira</a> nhamba iyi. Akauya — achitamba — ne129,864,880 (“kusvika Svondo”). Akafungidzira nhamba iyi nekugadzira dhatabhesi yakabatana yemabhuku ese epasi rose. Kune izvi, akaunganidza maDatasets akasiyana uye akazobatanidza nenzira dzakasiyana."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text3"
msgstr "Sezvine chinguva, pane mumwe munhu akaedza kuunganidza mabhuku ese ari pasi rose: Aaron Swartz, mushakabvu mushandirapamwe wedhijitari uye muvambi weReddit.<sup>3</sup> Akatanga <a %(youtube)s>Open Library</a> nechinangwa chekuva \"peji rewebhu rimwe nerimwe bhuku rakamboburitswa\", achibatanidza data kubva kumasosi akasiyana siyana. Akazopedzisira abhadhara mutengo wakanyanya webasa rake rekuchengetedza dhijitari paakazopomerwa mhosva yekurodha mapepa ezvidzidzo, zvichitungamira kuzviuraya kwake. Hazvifanirwe kutaurwa, ichi ndicho chimwe chezvikonzero boka redu riri kushandisa mazita ekunyepedzera, uye nei tiri kungwarira zvikuru. Open Library ichiri kutungamirwa nevanhu paInternet Archive, ichiramba nhaka yaAaron. Tichadzokera pane izvi gare gare muchinyorwa chino."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text4"
msgstr "Mublog post yeGoogle, Taycher anotsanangura zvimwe zvezvinetso pakufungidzira nhamba iyi. Chekutanga, chii chinonzi bhuku? Pane tsananguro dzinogona kuitika:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.copies"
msgstr "<strong>Mabhuku epanyama.</strong> Zviri pachena kuti izvi hazvibatsiri zvikuru, sezvo ari makopi akafanana ezvinhu zvakafanana. Zvingave zvakanaka dai taigona kuchengetedza zvese zvinyorwa zvinoitwa nevanhu mumabhuku, senge \"scribbles in the margins\" yaFermat. Asi, zvinosuruvarisa, izvo zvicharamba zviri kurota kwemuchengeti wezvinyorwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.works"
msgstr "<strong>“Mabasa”.</strong> Semuenzaniso \"Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets\" sechinhu chine musoro, chinosanganisira shanduro dzese dzacho, senge shanduro dzakasiyana uye kudhindwa patsva. Iyi imhando inobatsira yetsananguro, asi zvinogona kuoma kudhirowa mutsetse wezvinotarisirwa. Semuenzaniso, tinogona kuda kuchengetedza shanduro dzakasiyana, kunyangwe kudhindwa patsva kune misiyano midiki kungave kusina kukosha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.editions"
msgstr "<strong>“Shanduro”.</strong> Pano unoverenga shanduro yega yega yakasarudzika yebhuku. Kana chero chinhu nezvacho chakasiyana, senge chifukidziro chakasiyana kana sumo yakasiyana, chinoverengwa sechimwe chinyorwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.files"
msgstr "<strong>Mafaira.</strong> Paunenge uchishanda nemaraibhurari emumvuri akadai seLibrary Genesis, Sci-Hub, kana Z-Library, pane imwezve nyaya yekufunga nezvayo. Panogona kuve nemascans akawanda eshanduro imwechete. Uye vanhu vanogona kugadzira shanduro dziri nani dzemafaira aripo, nekuskena zvinyorwa vachishandisa OCR, kana kugadzirisa mapeji akaskenwa pakona. Tinoda kungoverenga mafaira aya sechinyorwa chimwe chete, izvo zvaizoda metadata yakanaka, kana kuderedza kushandiswa kwekufanana kwemagwaro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text5"
msgstr "“Shanduro” inoita senge tsananguro inoshanda zvikuru yezvinonzi “mabhuku”. Zvinofadza, iyi tsananguro inoshandiswawo pakupa nhamba dzakasarudzika dzeISBN. ISBN, kana International Standard Book Number, inowanzoshandiswa mukutengeserana kwepasi rose, sezvo yakabatanidzwa nehurongwa hwepasi rose hwebarcode (\"International Article Number\"). Kana uchida kutengesa bhuku muzvitoro, rinoda barcode, saka unowana ISBN."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text6"
msgstr "Blog post yaTaycher inotaura kuti kunyangwe maISBN achibatsira, haasi epasi rose, sezvo akangotambirwa chaizvo pakati pemakore makumi manomwe, uye kwete kwese kwese pasi rose. Zvakadaro, ISBN ndiyo inonyanya kushandiswa kuzivikanwa kweshanduro dzemabhuku, saka ndiyo yedu yekutanga yakanakisa. Kana tikakwanisa kuwana maISBN ese ari pasi rose, tinowana runyorwa runobatsira rwemabhuku achiri kuda kuchengetedzwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text7"
msgstr "Saka, tinowana kupi data? Pane nhamba yezvirongwa zviripo zviri kuyedza kuunganidza runyorwa rwemabhuku ese ari pasi rose:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.google"
msgstr "<strong>Google.</strong> Mushure mezvose, vakaita tsvakiridzo iyi yeGoogle Books. Zvisinei, metadata yavo haina kuwanikwa muhuwandu uye yakaoma kuikwenya."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.openlib"
msgstr "<strong>Open Library.</strong> Sezvambotaurwa, iri ndiro basa ravo rose. Vakawana huwandu hukuru hwedata remaraibhurari kubva kumaraibhurari anobatana uye maarchive enyika, uye vanoramba vachidaro. Ivo zvakare vane maraibhurari evashandi uye timu yehunyanzvi iri kuyedza kuderedza marekodhi, uye kuamaka nemhando dzese dzemetadata. Chinonyanya kufadza, dataset yavo yakavhurika zvachose. Unogona kungo <a %(openlibrary)s>kuikanda pasi</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.worldcat"
msgstr "<strong>WorldCat.</strong> Iyi iwebsite inotungamirwa neasiri purofiti OCLC, inotengesa masisitimu ekutonga emaraibhurari. Vanounganidza metadata yemabhuku kubva kumaraibhurari mazhinji, uye vanoita kuti iwanikwe kuburikidza newebsite yeWorldCat. Zvisinei, ivo zvakare vanoita mari nekutengesa data iri, saka haina kuwanikwa mukurodha kwakawanda. Ivo vane mamwe maDatasets akaganhurirwa kuwanikwa kurodha, mukubatana nemaraibhurari chaiwo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.isbndb"
msgstr "<strong>ISBNdb.</strong> Iyi ndiyo nyaya yeblog post iyi. ISBNdb inokwenya mawebhusaiti akasiyana siyana kuti iwane metadata yemabhuku, kunyanya data remutengo, iro rinotengeswa kune vatengesi vemabhuku, kuti vagone kutara mitengo yemabhuku avo zvinoenderana nemusika wese. Sezvo maISBN ave akajairika mazuva ano, ivo vakavaka \"peji rewebhu rebhuku rega rega\"."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.ils"
msgstr "<strong>Masisitimu emaraibhurari akasiyana uye maarchive.</strong> Pane maraibhurari nemaarchive asina kuiswa muchirongwa uye kuunganidzwa neaya ari pamusoro, kazhinji nekuti haana mari yakakwana, kana nekuda kwechimwe chikonzero haadi kugovera data ravo neOpen Library, OCLC, Google, nezvimwe. Mazhinji eaya ane marekodhi edhijitari anowanikwa kuburikidza neinternet, uye haawanzo chengetedzwa zvakanaka, saka kana uchida kubatsira uye kunakidzwa nekudzidza nezvemaraibhurari asinganzwisisike, aya ndiwo mapoinzi ekutanga akanaka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text8"
msgstr "Muchinyorwa chino, tinofara kuzivisa kuburitswa kudiki (kana tichienzanisa nekuburitswa kwedu kweZ-Library kare). Takakwenya mazhinji eISBNdb, uye takaita kuti data riwanikwe kutorrenting pawebsite yePirate Library Mirror (EDIT: yakaendeswa ku<a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>; hatizobatanidzi pano zvakananga, ingotsvaka). Aya angangoita 30.9 miriyoni marekodhi (20GB se<a %(jsonlines)s>JSON Lines</a>; 4.4GB gzipped). Pawebsite yavo vanoti vane 32.6 miriyoni marekodhi, saka tinogona kunge takanganisa mamwe, kana <em>ivo</em> vangave vachikanganisa chimwe chinhu. Chero zvazvingava, parizvino hatizogoveri chaizvo kuti takazviita sei — tichasiya izvozvo semubvunzo kumuverengi. ;-)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text9"
msgstr "Zvatichagovera imwe ongororo yekutanga, kuyedza kusvika padhuze nekufungidzira huwandu hwemabhuku ari pasi rose. Takatarisa maDatasets matatu: iyi nyowani ISBNdb dataset, kuburitswa kwedu kwepakutanga kwemetadata yatakakwenya kubva kuZ-Library shadow library (inosanganisira Library Genesis), uye Open Library data dump."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text10"
msgstr "Ngatitangei nenhamba dzakakomberedza:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text11"
msgstr "Muzvose Z-Library/Libgen neOpen Library mune mabhuku mazhinji kupfuura maISBN akasarudzika. Izvi zvinoreva here kuti mabhuku mazhinji haana maISBN, kana kuti metadata yeISBN yakangoshayikwa? Tinogona kupindura mubvunzo uyu nekubatanidza kwemaitiro ekufananidza otomatiki zvichienderana nezvimwe zvinhu (zita, munyori, muparidzi, nezvimwe), kuunza mamwe masosi edata, uye kutora maISBN kubva kumascans chaiwo emabhuku (panyaya yeZ-Library/Libgen)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text12"
msgstr "Mangani eaya maISBN akasarudzika? Izvi zvinonyatsoratidzwa neVenn diagram:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text13"
msgstr "Kuti tive vakanyatsojeka:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text14"
msgstr "Takashamiswa nekushamiswa kwatakaita nekushoma kwekuwirirana! ISBNdb ine huwandu hukuru hweISBNs dzisingaonekwi muZ-Library kana Open Library, uye zvakafanana (kunyange zvishoma asi zvakakosha) kune mamwe maviri. Izvi zvinomutsa mibvunzo mitsva yakawanda. Ko kuenzanisa kwemaoko kungabatsira zvakadii mukumaka mabhuku asina kumakwa neISBNs? Ko paizove nemaitiro mazhinji uye nekudaro kuwirirana kwakawedzerwa? Uye, chii chingaitika kana tikauya neyechina kana yechishanu dataset? Ko kuwirirana kwakadii kwataizoona ipapo?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text15"
msgstr "Izvi zvinotipa nzvimbo yekutanga. Tinogona ikozvino kutarisa maISBNs ese asina kuve muZ-Library dataset, uye asingaenderane neminda yetitle/author. Izvi zvinogona kutipa nzira yekuchengetedza mabhuku ese ari pasi rose: kutanga nekukwenya internet kuti tiwane scans, tobva taenda kunze kwehupenyu chaihwo kuti tione mabhuku. Izvi zvinogona kutokwenenzverwa nemari yevanhu, kana kutungamirwa ne \"bounties\" kubva kuvanhu vanoda kuona mabhuku akati wandei achiiswa mudhijitari. Zvese izvozvo inyaya yenguva yakasiyana."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text16"
msgstr "Kana uchida kubatsira mune chero cheizvi — kuongorora kwakadzama; kukwenya metadata yakawanda; kutsvaga mabhuku akawanda; OCR’ing yemabhuku; kuita izvi kune mamwe minda (semuenzaniso mapepa, maudiobooks, mafirimu, zviratidziro zveTV, magazini) kana kutokuita kuti imwe yedata iri iwanikwe pazvinhu zvakaita seML / kudzidziswa kwemamodeli emutauro makuru — ndapota taura neni (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text17"
msgstr "Kana uchifarira zvakanyanya kuongorora data, tiri kushanda pakuita kuti maDatasets edu nemascript awanikwe mune imwe nzira iri nyore kushandisa. Zvingave zvakanaka kana ukangotora notebook uye wotanga kutamba nezvazvo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text18"
msgstr "Pakupedzisira, kana uchida kutsigira basa iri, ndapota funga kuita mupiro. Iyi inyaya inotungamirwa nevanozvipira zvachose, uye mupiro wako unoita mutsauko mukuru. Chidimbu chega chega chinobatsira. Parizvino tinotora mipiro mucrypto; ona peji reDonate paAnna’s Archive."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.signature"
msgstr "- Anna uye timu (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn1"
msgstr "1. Kune imwe tsananguro inonzwisisika ye \"kusingaperi\". ;)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn2"
msgstr "2. Ehezve, nhaka yakanyorwa yevanhu yakawanda kupfuura mabhuku, kunyanya mazuva ano. Nekuda kwechinyorwa ichi uye kuburitswa kwedu kwazvino tiri kutarisa pamabhuku, asi zvido zvedu zvinotambanudzira mberi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn3"
msgstr "3. Pane zvakawanda zvinogona kutaurwa nezvaAaron Swartz, asi taingoda kumutaura muchidimbu, sezvo ane basa rakakosha munyaya iyi. Sezvo nguva inopfuura, vanhu vazhinji vanogona kusangana nezita rake kekutanga, uye vanogona kuzopinda mugomba regonzo ivo pachavo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.title"
msgstr "Hwindo rakakosha remaraibhurari emumvuri"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.tldr"
msgstr "Tingati sei tiri kuchengetedza maunganidzwa edu nekusingaperi, kana achitotanga kusvika 1 PB?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.links"
msgstr "<a %(critical_window_chinese)s>Shanduro yeChinese 中文版</a>, kurukura pa <a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(news_ycombinator)s>Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.text1"
msgstr "PaAnna’s Archive, tinowanzo bvunzwa kuti tingati sei tiri kuchengetedza maunganidzwa edu nekusingaperi, apo saizi yese yatotanga kusvika 1 Petabyte (1000 TB), uye ichiri kukura. Muchinyorwa chino tichatarisa pane dzidziso yedu, uye tione kuti nei makore gumi anotevera akakosha kumishoni yedu yekuchengetedza ruzivo uye tsika dzevanhu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.fig1"
msgstr "Iyo <a %(annas_archive_stats)s>saizi yese</a> yemaunganidzwa edu, mumwedzi mishoma yapfuura, yakaputswa pasi nenhamba yevatambi vetorrent."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities"
msgstr "Zvinokosheswa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text1"
msgstr "Sei tichifarira zvakanyanya mapepa nemabhuku? Ngatiregei parutivi kutenda kwedu kwekutanga mukuchengetedza kazhinji — tinogona kunyora imwe posvo nezvazvo. Saka sei mapepa nemabhuku chaiwo? Mhinduro iri nyore: <strong>kugona kweruzivo</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text2"
msgstr "Pamegabyte yega yega yekuchengetedza, zvinyorwa zvakanyorwa zvinotakura ruzivo rwakanyanya kupfuura zvimwe zvese. Nepo tichifarira zvese ruzivo netsika, tinonyanya kufarira zvekutanga. Kazhinji, tinoona hierarchy yekugona kweruzivo uye kukosha kwekuchengetedza kunotaridzika kunge uku:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.papers"
msgstr "Mapepa ezvidzidzo, magazini, mishumo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.organic"
msgstr "Data rechisikigo senge DNA sequences, mbeu dzemiti, kana sampuli dzehutachiona"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.nonfiction-books"
msgstr "Mabhuku asiri engano"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.code"
msgstr "Kodzisoftware yesainzi uye mainjiniya"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.measurements"
msgstr "Dhata rekuyera senge kuyera kwesainzi, dhata rezvehupfumi, mishumo yemakambani"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.science-websites"
msgstr "Mawebhusaiti esainzi uye mainjiniya, nhaurirano dzepamhepo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.nonfiction-other"
msgstr "Magazini asiri efungidziro, mapepanhau, manyoro"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.nonfiction-transcripts"
msgstr "Mavhidhiyo asiri efungidziro ematauriro, zvinyorwa, mapodcasts"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.leaks"
