#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.metadata"
msgstr "Marekodhi emetadata kazhinji (ezvisiri fungidziro uye fungidziro; zvimwe zvemidhiya, hunyanzvi, vanhu, nezvimwe; kusanganisira ongororo)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.geographic"
msgstr "Dhata rematunhu (semuenzaniso, mepu, ongororo yematongo)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.transcripts"
msgstr "Zvinyorwa zvematare kana mhosva"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.order.fiction"
msgstr "Shanduro dzefungidziro kana varaidzo yezvose zviri pamusoro"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text3"
msgstr "Kukwirira mune iyi rondedzero kwakati wandei kusarudzika — zvinhu zvakati wandei zvakaenzana kana kuti pane kusawirirana mukati mechikwata chedu — uye tinogona kunge tichikanganwa mamwe mapoka akakosha. Asi izvi zvinoratidza kuti tinokoshesa sei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text4"
msgstr "Zvimwe zvezvinhu izvi zvakasiyana zvakanyanya nezvimwe zvekuti hatifanire kunetseka nazvo (kana kuti zvakatotorwa nevamwe masangano), senge dhata remasikirwo kana dhata rematunhu. Asi zvakawanda zvezvinhu zviri murondedzero iyi zvakakosha kwatiri."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text5"
msgstr "Chimwe chinhu chikuru mukukoshesa kwedu ndechekuti basa rakati riri panjodzi zvakadii. Tinoda kutarisa pamabasa ari:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.rarity.rare"
msgstr "Asingawanikwi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.rarity.underfocused"
msgstr "Asingatariswe zvakakwana"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.rarity.at-risk"
msgstr "Ari panjodzi yakasarudzika yekuparadzwa (semuenzaniso, nehondo, kuderedzwa kwemari, mhosva, kana kushungurudzwa kwezvematongerwo enyika)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text6"
msgstr "Pakupedzisira, tinokoshesa chiyero. Tine nguva nemari shoma, saka tinoda kushandisa mwedzi tichiponesa mabhuku 10,000 pane 1,000 mabhuku — kana akakosha zvakafanana uye ari panjodzi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib"
msgstr "Maraibhurari emumvuri"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text1"
msgstr "Pane masangano mazhinji ane mabasa akafanana, uye zvinangwa zvakafanana. Chokwadi, kune maraibhurari, maarchive, marabhoritari, mamuseum, uye mamwe masangano akapihwa basa rekuchengetedza rudzi urwu. Mazhinji acho anotsigirwa zvakanaka, nehurumende, vanhu, kana makambani. Asi ane imwe nzvimbo huru isingaonekwi: hurongwa hwemutemo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text2"
msgstr "Pano ndipo panouya basa rakasarudzika remaraibhurari emumvuri, uye chikonzero Anna’s Archive iripo. Tinogona kuita zvinhu izvo mamwe masangano asingabvumirwi kuita. Zvino, hazvisi (kazhinji) kuti tinogona kuisa muzvinyorwa zvinhu zvisiri pamutemo kuchengetedza kumwe. Kwete, zviri pamutemo munzvimbo zhinji kuvaka archive nemabhuku chero api, mapepa, magazini, uye zvichingodaro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text3"
msgstr "Asi kazhinji zvinyorwa zviri pamutemo zvinotadza kuve ne <strong>kudzokororwa uye kugara kwenguva refu</strong>. Pane mabhuku ane kopi imwe chete iripo mune imwe raibhurari yemuviri kumwe kunhu. Pane zvinyorwa zvemetadata zvinorindirwa nekambani imwe chete. Pane mapepanhau anochengetwa chete pamicrofilm mune imwe archive. Maraibhurari anogona kutemwa mari, makambani anogona kuparara, zvinyorwa zvinogona kuputika uye kupiswa pasi. Izvi hazvisi fungidziro — izvi zvinoitika nguva dzose."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text4"
msgstr "Chinhu chatinogona kuita zvakanyanya paAnna’s Archive kuchengetedza makopi mazhinji emabasa, pamwero mukuru. Tinogona kuunganidza mapepa, mabhuku, magazini, nezvimwe, uye kuaparadzira muhuwandu. Parizvino tinoita izvi kuburikidza nematorrent, asi matekinoroji chaiwo haana basa uye achachinja nekufamba kwenguva. Chinhu chakakosha ndechekuti makopi mazhinji aparadzirwe pasi rose. Iyi quote kubva makore anopfuura 200 apfuura ichiri kurira ichokwadi:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.quote.the-lost"
msgstr "<em><q>Izvo zvakarasika hazvigone kudzorerwa; asi ngatichengetei izvo zvasara: kwete nemakomba uye makiyi anovadzivirira kubva pakuonekwa kweveruzhinji uye kushandiswa, mukuvaisa kumarara enguva, asi nekudzokororwa kwemakopi, izvo zvichavaisa kunze kwekusvikirwa netsaona.</q></em><br>— Thomas Jefferson, 1791"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text5"
msgstr "Chinyorwa chipfupi pamusoro peveruzhinji domain. Sezvo Anna’s Archive ichinyanya kutarisa pazviitwa zvisiri pamutemo munzvimbo dzakawanda pasi rose, hatinetseki nezviunganidzwa zvinowanikwa zvakanyanya, zvakadai semabhuku everuzhinji domain. Masangano epamutemo anowanzo kutotarisira izvozvo zvakanaka. Zvisinei, pane zvimwe zvinhu zvinoita kuti dzimwe nguva tishande pane zvinowanikwa pachena:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.metadata"
msgstr "Zvinyorwa zvemetadata zvinogona kutariswa pachena pawebhusaiti yeWorldcat, asi hazvigone kudhawunirodhwa muhuwandu (kusvikira tazvi <a %(worldcat_scrape)s>scraped</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.github"
msgstr "Kodhi inogona kuva open source paGithub, asi Github yose haigone kuve nyore kuenzaniswa uye nekudaro kuchengetedzwa (kunyange mune iyi nyaya pane makopi akapararira zvakakwana ezvinyorwa zvakawanda zvekodhi)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.reddit"
msgstr "Reddit yakasununguka kushandisa, asi ichangobva kuisa matanho akasimba ekudzivirira scraping, mukumuka kwekudzidziswa kweLLM kunoda data (zvimwe pamusoro pazvo gare gare)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies"
msgstr "Kuwedzerwa kwemakopi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies.text1"
msgstr "Kudzokera kumubvunzo wedu wepakutanga: tingati sei tiri kuchengetedza zvinyorwa zvedu nekusingaperi? Dambudziko guru pano nderekuti muunganidzwa wedu wanga uri <a %(torrents_stats)s>kukura</a> nekukurumidza, nekusveta uye nekuburitsa pachena mamwe maunganidzwa makuru (pamusoro pebasa rinoshamisa ratove kuitwa nemamwe maraibhurari emumvuri akadai seSci-Hub neLibrary Genesis)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies.text2"
msgstr "Kukura uku kwedata kunoita kuti zvinyorwa zvive zvakaoma kuenzaniswa pasi rose. Kuchengetedza data kunodhura! Asi tiri netariro, kunyanya patinotarisa maitiro matatu anotevera."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit"
msgstr "1. Takatora michero iri pasi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit.text1"
msgstr "Iyi inotevera zvakananga kubva pamapriorities edu akakurukurwa pamusoro. Tinoda kushanda pakusunungura maunganidzwa makuru kutanga. Zvino zvatawana mamwe maunganidzwa makuru pasi rose, tinotarisira kukura kwedu kuve kunonoka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit.text2"
msgstr "Kuchine muswe wakareba wemaunganidzwa madiki, uye mabhuku matsva anoramba achionekwa kana kuburitswa zuva rega rega, asi mwero ungangove unononoka. Tinogona kutokura kana kutotriwa muhukuru, asi panguva yakareba."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage"
msgstr "2. Mutengo wekuchengetedza unoramba uchidonha zvakanyanya"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text1"
msgstr "Panguva yekunyora, <a %(diskprices)s>mitengo yedhisiki</a> paTB iri kutenderedza $12 yedhisiki nyowani, $8 yedhisiki yakashandiswa, uye $4 yetepi. Kana tiri kutarisa zvine mwero uye tichitarisa chete pamadhisiki matsva, zvinoreva kuti kuchengetedza petabyte kunodhura angangoita $12,000. Kana tikafungidzira raibhurari yedu ichatatu kubva pa900TB kusvika 2.7PB, izvo zvingareva $32,400 kuti tienzanise raibhurari yedu yese. Kuwedzera magetsi, mutengo wezvimwe zvigadzirwa, uye zvichingodaro, ngatipoteredze ku $40,000. Kana netepi zvimwe $15,000–$20,000."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text2"
msgstr "Kune rimwe divi <strong>$15,000–$40,000 yehuwandu hwese hweruzivo rwevanhu ibasa</strong>. Kune rimwe divi, zvishoma kuti kutarisira matani emakopi akazara, kunyanya kana tichida kuti vanhu ivavo varambe vachisima matorrent avo kuti vabatsire vamwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text3"
msgstr "Izvo ndizvo nhasi. Asi kufambira mberi kunoenderera mberi:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text4"
msgstr "Mitengo yedhisiki rakaoma paTB yakaputswa zvishoma nezvishoma mumakore gumi apfuura, uye icharamba ichidonha nemutengo wakafanana. Tepi inoita kunge iri munzira yakafanana. Mitengo yeSSD iri kudonha nekukurumidza, uye inogona kutora mitengo yeHDD panopera makore gumi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.hdd-prices"
msgstr "Maitiro emitengo yeHDD kubva kune dzakasiyana sosi (dzvanya kuti uone chidzidzo)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text5"
msgstr "Kana izvi zvikabata, ipapo mumakore gumi tinogona kutarisa pa $5,000–$13,000 chete kuti tienzanise muunganidzwa wedu wese (1/3rd), kana kunyange zvishoma kana tikakura zvishoma muhukuru. Nepo ichiri mari yakawanda, izvi zvichave zvinowanikwa kune vanhu vakawanda. Uye zvinogona kunge zviri nani nekuda kwechimwe chikonzero chinotevera…"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density"
msgstr "3. Kuvandudzwa kwekuwanda kwemashoko"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text1"
msgstr "Parizvino tinochengeta mabhuku mumafomati asina kuchinjwa sezvaanotumirwa kwatiri. Chokwadi, anenge akamanikidzwa, asi kazhinji anenge ari makuru scans kana mifananidzo yemapeji."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text2"
msgstr "Kusvika parizvino, sarudzo dzega dzekuderedza hukuru hwese hwekuunganidza kwedu kwave kuburikidza nekumanikidza kwakanyanya, kana kuderedza zvakapetwa. Zvisinei, kuti tiwane kuchengetedza kwakakwana, zvose izvi zvinorasikirwa zvakanyanya nemhando yedu. Kumanikidza kwakanyanya kwemifananidzo kunogona kuita kuti zvinyorwa zvisave nyore kuverenga. Uye kuderedza zvakapetwa kunoda kuvimba kwakanyanya kuti mabhuku akafanana chaizvo, izvo zvinowanzove zvisina kunyatsojeka, kunyanya kana zvirimo zvakafanana asi scans dzakaitwa panguva dzakasiyana."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text3"
msgstr "Pane nguva dzose paine imwe sarudzo, asi mhando yayo yave yakashata zvekuti hatina kumbofunga nezvayo: <strong>OCR, kana Optical Character Recognition</strong>. Iyi ndiyo nzira yekushandura mifananidzo kuita zvinyorwa zvakajeka, nekushandisa AI kuona mavara mumifananidzo. Zvishandiso zveizvi zvagara zviripo, uye zvave zvakanaka, asi \"zvakanaka\" hazvina kukwana kune zvinangwa zvekuchengetedza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text4"
msgstr "Zvisinei, mamodheru ekudzidza kwakadzama kwe multi-modal achangobva kuita kufambira mberi nekukurumidza, kunyange hazvo pamutengo wakakwira. Tinotarisira kuti kunyatsojeka uye mitengo zvichavandudzika zvakanyanya mumakore anouya, kusvika pakuti zvichave zvine musoro kushandisa kune yese raibhurari yedu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.ocr"
msgstr "Kuvandudzwa kweOCR."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text5"
msgstr "Kana izvi zvaitika, tinogona kunge tichiri kuchengetedza mafaera ekutanga, asi zvakare tinogona kuve neiyo diki vhezheni yeraibhurari yedu iyo vanhu vazhinji vachada kutevedzera. Chinokosha ndechekuti zvinyorwa zvakajeka pachazvo zvinomanikidzwa zvirinani, uye zviri nyore kuderedza zvakapetwa, zvichitipa kuchengetedza kwakawanda."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text6"
msgstr "Kazhinji hazvisi zvisingatarisirwi kutarisira kuderedzwa kwe5-10x muhukuru hwese hwefaera, pamwe kunyange zvakawanda. Kunyangwe nekuderedzwa kwe5x, tinenge tichitarisa <strong> $1,000–$3,000 mumakore gumi kunyange kana raibhurari yedu ikapetwa katatu muhukuru </strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window"
msgstr "Nguva yakakosha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text1"
msgstr "Kana fungidziro idzi dzakarurama, isu <strong>tinongoda kumirira makore mashoma</strong> tisati yese kuunganidzwa kwedu kwatevedzerwa zvakanyanya. Saka, mumashoko aThomas Jefferson, \"kuiswa kunze kwekusvikika kwetsaona.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text2"
msgstr "Zvinosuruvarisa, kuoneka kweLLMs, uye kuda kwavo data kwakanyanya, kwaita kuti vazhinji vane kodzero dzekopiraiti vave nekudzivirira. Zvakanyanya kupfuura zvavakanga vatove. Mawebhusaiti mazhinji ari kuita kuti zvive zvakaoma kukwenya uye kuchengetedza, mhosva dziri kutenderera, uye panguva imwecheteyo raibhurari dzemanyama uye zvinyorwa zvichiramba zvichisiiwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text3"
msgstr "Tinogona kungotarisira kuti maitiro aya acharamba achiwedzera kuipa, uye mabasa mazhinji acharasika asati apinda munzvimbo yeruzhinji."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text4"
msgstr "<strong>Tiri pamberi pekuchinja kukuru mukuchengetedza, asi <q>zvakarasika hazvigone kuwanikwa zvakare.</q></strong> Tine hwindo rakakosha remakore 5-10 umo zvichiri kudhura kushanda raibhurari yemumvuri uye kugadzira akawanda magirazi pasi rose, uye panguva iyo kuwana hakusati kwavharwa zvachose."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text5"
msgstr "Kana tikakwanisa kuyambuka hwindo iri, ipapo tichange takachengetedza ruzivo uye tsika dzevanhu nekusingaperi. Hatifanire kurega nguva iyi ichiparara. Hatifanire kurega hwindo rakakosha iri richivharika patiri."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text6"
msgstr "Ngatimboendei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.signature"
msgstr "- Anna nechikwata (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.title"
msgstr "Kuwanikwa kwega kumakambani eLLM kuunganidzwa kukuru kwazvo kwemabhuku asiri engano echiChinese pasi rose"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.subtitle"
msgstr "<a %(duxiu_exclusive_chinese)s>Shanduro yeChinese 中文版</a>, <a %(news_ycombinator)s>Kurukura paHacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.tldr"
msgstr "<em><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Anna’s Archive yakawana kuunganidzwa kwe7.5 miriyoni / 350TB yemabhuku asiri engano echiChinese - yakakura kupfuura Library Genesis. Tiri kuda kupa kambani yeLLM kuwana kwega, mukutsinhana neOCR yemhando yepamusoro uye kutora zvinyorwa.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text1"
msgstr "Iyi ipositi pfupi yeblog. Tiri kutsvaga imwe kambani kana sangano kuti tibatsirane neOCR uye kutora zvinyorwa kune kuunganidzwa kukuru kwatakawana, mukutsinhana nekuwana kwega kwekutanga. Mushure menguva yekuvharirwa, tichaburitsa kuunganidzwa kwese."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text2"
msgstr "Magwaro emhando yepamusoro edzidzo anobatsira zvikuru pakudzidzisa maLLM. Kunyangwe muunganidzwa wedu uri weChinese, izvi zvinofanira kubatsira pakudzidzisa maLLM eChirungu: mamodheru anoita kunge anobata pfungwa neruzivo zvisinei nemutauro wepakutanga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text3"
msgstr "Kune izvi, magwaro anofanira kutorwa kubva kumascans. Chii chinowana Anna’s Archive kubva mairi? Kutsvaga kwese-kwemagwaro emabhuku kune vashandisi vayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text4"
msgstr "Nekuti zvinangwa zvedu zvinoenderana nezvevagadziri veLLM, tiri kutsvaga mushandirapamwe. Tiri kuda kukupa <strong>kupinda kwekutanga kwekuunganidzwa uku kwakawanda kwemakore 1</strong>, kana uchikwanisa kuita OCR nemazvo uye kutora magwaro. Kana uchida kugovera kodhi yese yepipeline yako nesu, tinenge tichida kuisa embargo pakuunganidzwa kwenguva yakareba."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages"
msgstr "Mienzaniso yemapeji"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages.text1"
msgstr "Kuti utiratidze kuti une pipeline yakanaka, heano mamwe mapeji emuenzaniso ekutanga, kubva mubhuku rine superconductors. Pipeline yako inofanira kubata zvakanaka masvomhu, matafura, machati, tsoka, nezvimwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages.text2"
msgstr "Tumira mapeji ako akagadziriswa kune email yedu. Kana achitaridzika zvakanaka, tichakutumira mamwe muchivande, uye tinotarisira kuti ugone kumhanyisa pipeline yako nekukurumidza pane iwo zvakare. Kana tichigutsikana, tinogona kuita chibvumirano."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection"
msgstr "Muunganidzwa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text1"
msgstr "Rimwe ruzivo nezvekuunganidzwa. <a %(duxiu)s>Duxiu</a> idhatabhesi hombe yemabhuku akascanned, yakagadzirwa ne <a %(chaoxing)s>SuperStar Digital Library Group</a>. Mazhinji mabhuku edzidzo, akascanned kuitira kuti awanikwe padigital kumayunivhesiti nemaraibhurari. Kune vateereri vedu veChirungu, <a %(library_princeton)s>Princeton</a> uye <a %(guides_lib_uw)s>University of Washington</a> vane ongororo dzakanaka. Pane zvakare chinyorwa chakanakisa chinopa mamwe mashure: <a %(doi)s>“Digitizing Chinese Books: A Case Study of the SuperStar DuXiu Scholar Search Engine”</a> (tarisa muAnna’s Archive)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text2"
msgstr "Mabhuku kubva kuDuxiu akabirwa kwenguva refu paChinese internet. Kazhinji ari kutengeswa nemutengo uri pasi pe dhora nevatengesi. Anowanzo kugoverwa achishandisa chishandiso cheChinese chakafanana neGoogle Drive, icho chingave chakabirwa kuti chibvumire nzvimbo yakawanda yekuchengetera. Mamwe mashoko ehunyanzvi anogona kuwanikwa <a %(github_duty_machine)s>pano</a> uye <a %(github_821_github_io)s>pano</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text3"
msgstr "Kunyangwe mabhuku aya akagoverwa semi-pachena, zvakaoma kuawana zvakawanda. Takanga tazviisa pamusoro pechinyorwa chedu cheTODO, uye takapa mwedzi yakawanda yebasa rakazara. Zvisinei, nguva pfupi yadarika mumwe munhu anoshamisa, anoshamisa, uye ane tarenda akatibata, achiti vakanga vaita basa rese iri kare — nemutengo mukuru. Vakagovera muunganidzwa wese nesu, vasina kutarisira chero chinhu mukudzoka, kunze kwekuvimbiswa kwekuchengetedzwa kwenguva refu. Zvinoshamisa chaizvo. Vakabvuma kukumbira rubatsiro nenzira iyi kuti kuunganidzwa kuve OCR'ed."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text4"
msgstr "Muunganidzwa une mafaira 7,543,702. Izvi zvinopfuura Library Genesis non-fiction (inenge 5.3 miriyoni). Huwandu hwese hwemafaira hwakakura inenge 359TB (326TiB) muchimiro chayo chazvino."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text5"
msgstr "Tiri kuvhurika kune dzimwe pfungwa nemazano. Ingo taura nesu. Tarisa Anna’s Archive kuti uwane rumwe ruzivo nezvekuunganidzwa kwedu, kuedza kwekuchengetedza, uye kuti ungabatsira sei. Ndatenda!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.signoff"
msgstr "- Anna nechikwata (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.zlib-on-ipfs.deprecated"
msgstr "Yambiro: chinyorwa cheblog ichi chabviswa. Tasarudza kuti IPFS haisati yagadzirira nguva yayo. Tichiri kubatanidza kumafaira paIPFS kubva kuAnna’s Archive kana zvichibvira, asi hatichazvigamuchiri pachedu, uye hatikurudzire vamwe kuti vashandise IPFS. Ndapota ona peji redu reTorrents kana uchida kubatsira kuchengetedza muunganidzwa wedu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.zlib-on-ipfs.title"
msgstr "Batsira kuseed Z-Library paIPFS"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.title"
msgstr "Maitiro ekumhanyisa raibhurari yemumvuri: mashandiro paAnna’s Archive"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tldr"
msgstr "Hakuna <q>AWS yemumvuri masangano,</q> saka tinomhanyisa sei Anna’s Archive?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text1"
msgstr "Ini ndinomhanyisa <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>, injini huru yekutsvaga isingabhadharwi pasi rose yemaraibhurari emumvuri, seSci-Hub, Library Genesis, uye Z-Library. Chinangwa chedu ndechekuita kuti ruzivo netsika zvive nyore kuwanikwa, uye pakupedzisira kuvaka nharaunda yevanhu vanounganidza nekuchengetedza <a %(blog_isbndb_dump_how_many_books_are_preserved_forever)s>mabhuku ese ari pasi rose</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text2"
msgstr "Muchinyorwa chino ndicharatidza kuti tinomhanyisa sei webhusaiti iyi, uye matambudziko akasiyana anouya nekushanda newebhusaiti ine mamiriro epamutemo anokahadzika, sezvo pasina “AWS yemumvuri masangano”."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text3"
msgstr "<em>Tarisa zvakare chinyorwa chehanzvadzi <a %(blog_how_to_become_a_pirate_archivist)s>Maitiro ekuzova muunganidzi wemumvuri</a>.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens"
msgstr "Matambudziko ekugadzira"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text1"
msgstr "Ngatitangei nehurongwa hwedu hwemichina. Hwakagadzirirwa kuva hwakajairika. Tinoshandisa Flask, MariaDB, uye ElasticSearch. Izvo ndizvo chete. Kutsvaga kwakawanda kwakagadziriswa, uye hatina chinangwa chekuchigadzira patsva. Pamusoro pezvo, tinofanira kushandisa <a %(mcfunley)s>matambudziko ekugadzira</a> pane chimwe chinhu: kusabviswa nemasimba."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text2"
msgstr "Saka Anna’s Archive iri pamutemo here kana kuti kwete? Izvi zvinonyanya kuenderana nemutemo wenyika. Nyika zhinji dzinotenda mune imwe nzira yekodzero, zvinoreva kuti vanhu kana makambani anopihwa kodzero yakasarudzika pamabasa emhando dzakasiyana kwenguva yakati. Parutivi, paAnna’s Archive tinotenda kuti kunyangwe paine zvimwe zvakanakira, kodzero inowanzova nemigumisiro yakaipa munharaunda — asi iyo inyaya yeimwe nguva."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text3"
msgstr "Iyi kodzero yakasarudzika pamabasa emhando dzakasiyana zvinoreva kuti hazvisi pamutemo kune chero munhu kunze kwekodzero iyi kugovera mabasa aya zvakananga — kusanganisira isu. Asi Anna’s Archive injini yekutsvaga isingagoveri mabasa aya zvakananga (zvirinani kwete pawebsite yedu yakajeka), saka tinofanira kunge tiri pamutemo, handiti? Kwete chaizvo. Munzvimbo zhinji hazvisi pamutemo kugovera mabasa ane kodzero, asiwo kubatanidza kune nzvimbo dzinozviita. Muenzaniso wakajairika weizvi mutemo weDMCA weUnited States."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text4"
msgstr "Icho chikamu chakaomesesa chemutemo. Kune rimwe divi remutemo panogona kuve nenyika dzisina mutemo wekodzero zvachose, asi idzi hadzisi kuwanikwa. Nyika dzinenge dzese dzine imwe nzira yemutemo wekodzero. Kumanikidzwa inyaya yakasiyana. Kune nyika dzakawanda dzine hurumende dzisingade kumanikidza mutemo wekodzero. Kune zvakare nyika dziri pakati pemigumo miviri, dzinorambidza kugovera mabasa ane kodzero, asi hadzirambidzi kubatanidza kune mabasa akadaro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text5"
msgstr "Imwe nyaya ndeyekambani. Kana kambani ichishanda munzvimbo isingachengetedze kodzero, asi kambani pachayo isingade kutora chero njodzi, vanogona kuvhara website yako kana munhu akangonyunyuta nezvayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text6"
msgstr "Pakupedzisira, nyaya huru ndeyekubhadhara. Sezvo tichida kuramba tisingazivikanwi, hatigone kushandisa nzira dzechinyakare dzekubhadhara. Izvi zvinotisiyira nemari dzedhijitari, uye chete chikamu chidiki chemakambani chinotsigira idzi (pane makadhi edhijitari anobhadharwa nemari dzedhijitari, asi kazhinji haagamuchirwi)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture"
msgstr "Chimiro chehurongwa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text1"
msgstr "Saka ngatitii wakawana mamwe makambani anoda kubata website yako pasina kukuvhara — ngativadane \"vapi vechido cherusununguko\" 😄. Uchawana nekukurumidza kuti kubata zvese navo kunodhura, saka ungangoda kutsvaga \"vapi vechido chakachipa\" uye kuita kubata chaiko ikoko, uchipfuura kuburikidza nevapi vechido cherusununguko. Kana ukazviita nemazvo, vapi vechido chakachipa havazombonyatsoziva zvauri kubata, uye havazombogamuchira chero kunyunyuta."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text2"
msgstr "Nekune vese vapi ava pane njodzi yekuti vangakuvhare chero zvakadaro, saka unodawo redundancy. Tinoda izvi pamatanho ese ehurongwa hwedu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text3"
msgstr "Imwe kambani inoda rusununguko yakazviisa pachinzvimbo chinonakidza iCloudflare. Vakambotaura kuti havasi vapi vekubata, asi chishandiso, senge ISP. Saka havasi pasi peDMCA kana zvimwe zvikumbiro zvekubvisa, uye vanotumira chero zvikumbiro kumupi wako chaiye wekubata. Vakatoenda kudare kuchengetedza chimiro ichi. Tinogona saka kuvashandisa seimwe nhanho yekuchengetedza uye kuchengetedza."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text4"
msgstr "Cloudflare haibvumi kubhadhara kusingazivikanwi, saka tinogona chete kushandisa chirongwa chavo chemahara. Izvi zvinoreva kuti hatigone kushandisa maficha avo ekugovera mutoro kana ekukanganisa. Saka <a %(annas_archive_l255)s>takazviita tega</a> padanho redomain. Pakurodha peji, bhurawuza rinotarisa kana domain iripo, uye kana zvisiri, rinonyora patsva maURL ese kune imwe domain. Sezvo Cloudflare ichichengeta mapeji mazhinji, izvi zvinoreva kuti mushandisi anogona kusvika padomain yedu huru, kunyangwe server yeproxy yakadzika, uyezve pakudzvanya kunotevera anofambiswa kune imwe domain."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text5"
msgstr "Tichinewo nyaya dzakajairika dzekushanda dzekubata nadzo, senge kutarisa hutano hweseva, kunyora zvikanganiso zvebackend uye frontend, nezvimwe. Chimiro chedu chekugadzirisa chinobvumira kuwedzera kusimba pane izvi zvakare, semuenzaniso nekumhanyisa seti yakasiyana yeseva pane imwe yedomain. Tinogona kutomhanyisa shanduro dzekare dzekodhi uye datasets pane iyi domain yakasiyana, kana paine bug yakakomba mushanduro huru isingaonekwi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text6"
msgstr "Tinogonawo kudzivirira Cloudflare kutendeukira kwatiri, nekubvisa kubva kune imwe yedomain, senge iyi domain yakasiyana. Kusanganiswa kwakasiyana kwemazano aya kunogoneka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools"
msgstr "Zvishandiso"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text1"
msgstr "Ngatitarisei kuti zvishandiso zvatinoshandisa kuzadzisa zvese izvi. Izvi zviri kuchinja sezvatinosangana nematambudziko matsva uye tichitsvaga mhinduro nyowani."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.app"
msgstr "Seva yekushandisa: Flask, MariaDB, ElasticSearch, Docker."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.proxy"
msgstr "Seva yeproxy: Varnish."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.management"
msgstr "Kugadzirisa seva: Ansible, Checkmk, UFW."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.dev"
msgstr "Kuvandudza: Gitlab, Weblate, Zulip."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.onion"
msgstr "Onion static hosting: Tor, Nginx."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text2"
msgstr "Pane pane pane dzatinetsa kuita sarudzo. Imwe yacho ndeyekutaurirana pakati pemaseva: taimboshandisa Wireguard, asi takaona kuti dzimwe nguva inorega kutumira data, kana kutumira data kune rimwe divi chete. Izvi zvakaitika nemaitiro akasiyana eWireguard atakaedza, akadai se <a %(github_costela_wesher)s>wesher</a> uye <a %(github_k4yt3x_wg_meshconf)s>wg-meshconf</a>. Takaedzawo kutumira mapoto kuburikidza neSSH, tichishandisa autossh uye sshuttle, asi takasangana ne <a %(github_sshuttle)s>matambudziko ipapo</a> (kunyangwe hazvo zvisati zvanyatsojeka kwandiri kana autossh ichitambura nematambudziko eTCP-over-TCP kana kwete — zvinongonzwa sekunge mhinduro isina kusimba kwandiri asi pamwe zvakanaka?)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text3"
msgstr "Panzvimbo pezvo, takadzokera kumakoneki ekubatanidza maseva zvakananga, tichivanza kuti seva iri kumhanya pamupi akachipa tichishandisa IP-filtering neUFW. Izvi zvine chakaipa chekuti Docker haishande zvakanaka neUFW, kunze kwekunge washandisa <code>network_mode: \"host\"</code>. Zvese izvi zvinogona kukanganisa, nekuti unogona kuisa seva yako panjodzi yekuratidzwa paindaneti nekukanganisa kudiki. Pamwe tinofanira kudzokera kuautossh — mhinduro inogamuchirwa pano."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text4"
msgstr "Takamboshandisawo Varnish vs. Nginx. Parizvino tinofarira Varnish, asi ine zvimwe zvainonetsa nazvo. Izvo zvakafanana neCheckmk: hatizvifarire, asi zvinobatsira parizvino. Weblate yave yakanaka asi haisi inoshamisa — dzimwe nguva ndinotya kuti icharasikirwa nedata rangu pese pandinoedza kuisanganisa negit repo yedu. Flask yave yakanaka kazhinji, asi ine zvimwe zvinonetsa zvainazvo zvakatora nguva yakawanda kugadzirisa, sekugadzirisa madomains akasarudzika, kana matambudziko neSqlAlchemy integration yayo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text5"
msgstr "Kusvika parizvino mamwe maturusi ave akanaka: hatina zvichemo zvakakomba nezve MariaDB, ElasticSearch, Gitlab, Zulip, Docker, uye Tor. Zvese izvi zvave nezvimwe zvinonetsa, asi hapana chakanyanya kukomba kana kutora nguva yakawanda."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions"
