#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions.text1"
msgstr "Yave chiitiko chinonakidza kudzidza maitiro ekuisa injini yekutsvaga yakasimba uye yakasimba yemaraibhurari emumvuri. Pane zvakawanda zvakawanda zvekugovera mune zvinyorwa zvinotevera, saka ndiudze zvaungade kudzidza zvakawanda nezvazvo!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions.text2"
msgstr "Sezvagara, tiri kutsvaga mipiro yekutsigira basa iri, saka iva nechokwadi chekuongorora peji reDonate paAnna’s Archive. Tiri kutsvakawo dzimwe mhando dzekutsigira, senge mari, vanotsigira kwenguva refu, vanopa mari vane njodzi huru, pamwe kunyange (zvakanaka!) kushambadza. Uye kana uchida kupa nguva yako uye hunyanzvi, tiri kugara tichitsvaga vanogadzira, vashanduri, nezvimwe. Ndatenda nekufarira kwako uye rutsigiro."

