msgstr "1.3B WorldCat scrape"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.books-on-ipfs.title"
msgstr "Kuisa 5,998,794 mabhuku paIPFS"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.books-on-ipfs.deprecated"
msgstr "Yambiro: chinyorwa cheblog ichi chabviswa. Tasarudza kuti IPFS haisati yagadzirira nguva yayo. Tichiri kubatanidza kumafaira paIPFS kubva kuAnna’s Archive kana zvichibvira, asi hatichazvigamuchiri pachedu, uye hatikurudzire vamwe kuti vashandise IPFS. Ndapota ona peji redu reTorrents kana uchida kubatsira kuchengetedza muunganidzwa wedu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.tldr"
msgstr "<em><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Anna’s Archive yakakwenya zvese zveWorldCat (raibhurari huru kwazvo yemetadata) kuti igadzire runyorwa rweMABHUKU anoda kuchengetedzwa.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text1"
msgstr "Gore rapfuura, takatanga <a %(blog)s>kutsvaga</a> mhinduro kumubvunzo uyu: <strong>Chikamu chipi chemabhuku chakachengetedzwa zvachose nemaraibhurari emumvuri?</strong>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text2"
msgstr "Kana bhuku rapinda muraibhurari yemumvuri yakavhurika-data se <a %(wikipedia_library_genesis)s>Library Genesis</a>, uye ikozvino <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>, rinoratidzwa pasi rose (kuburikidza nematorrent), nokudaro richirichengetedza zvachose."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text3"
msgstr "Kuti tipindure mubvunzo wekuti chikamu chipi chemabhuku chakachengetedzwa, tinofanira kuziva denominator: mangani mabhuku aripo zvachose? Uye zvakakodzera hatina nhamba chete, asi metadata chaiyo. Ipapo tinogona kwete kungoenzanisa nemaraibhurari emumvuri, asiwo <strong>kugadzira runyorwa rweMABHUKU asara ekuchengetedza!</strong> Tinogona kutotanga kurota nezvekuedza kwevanhu vazhinji kupedza runyorwa urwu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text4"
msgstr "Takatora <a %(wikipedia_isbndb_com)s>ISBNdb</a>, uye takadhawunirodha <a %(openlibrary)s>Open Library dataset</a>, asi migumisiro yacho yakanga isingagutsi. Dambudziko guru raive rekuti pakanga pasina kuwirirana kwakawanda kweISBNs. Ona iyi Venn dhayagiramu kubva ku <a %(blog)s>chinyorwa chedu chebhurogu</a>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text5"
msgstr "Takashamiswa zvikuru nekushomeka kwekuwirirana pakati peISBNdb neOpen Library, izvo zvese zvinobatanidza data kubva kune dzakasiyana siyana, senge web scrapes uye marekodhi emaraibhurari. Kana vese vachinge vaita basa rakanaka pakuwana maISBN mazhinji aripo, madenderedzwa avo anofanira kunge aine kuwirirana kukuru, kana kuti imwe ingave iri subset yeimwe. Izvi zvakaita kuti tishamisike, mangani mabhuku anowira <em>kunze kweaya madenderedzwa</em>? Tinoda dhatabhesi hombe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.worldcat"
msgstr "WorldCat"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text6"
msgstr "Ndipo patakatarisa dhatabhesi hombe yemabhuku pasi rose: <a %(wikipedia_worldcat)s>WorldCat</a>. Iyi idhatabhesi inobatwa neasiri purofiti <a %(wikipedia_oclc)s>OCLC</a>, iyo inounganidza metadata marekodhi kubva kumaraibhurari pasi rose, mukutsinhana nekuvapa mukana kune dataset izere, uye kuti vaonekwe mumigumisiro yekutsvaga kwevashandisi vekupedzisira."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text7"
msgstr "Kunyangwe OCLC isiri purofiti, modhi yavo yebhizinesi inoda kuchengetedza dhatabhesi yavo. Zvakanaka, tinodemba kutaura, shamwari dzeOCLC, tiri kuzvipa zvese. :-)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text8"
msgstr "Mugore rapfuura, takanyatso takura marekodhi ese eWorldCat. Pakutanga, takawana mukana wakanaka. WorldCat yakanga ichangotanga kuvandudza webhusaiti yavo (muna Nyamavhuvhu 2022). Izvi zvaisanganisira kugadziridzwa kukuru kwemasisitimu avo ekumashure, zvichiunza zvikanganiso zvakawanda zvekuchengetedza. Takabva tatora mukana uyu, uye takakwanisa kutora mazana emamiriyoni (!) emarekodhi mumazuva mashoma."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.alt.redesign"
msgstr "<em>WorldCat redesign</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text9"
msgstr "Pashure paizvozvo, zvikanganiso zvekuchengetedza zvakatanga kugadziriswa zvishoma nezvishoma, kusvikira yekupedzisira yatakawana yakagadziriswa mwedzi wapfuura. Panguva iyoyo takanga tave nemarekodhi ese, uye taingotsvaga marekodhi emhando yepamusoro zvishoma. Saka takanzwa kuti inguva yekuburitsa!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text10"
msgstr "Ngatitarisei rumwe ruzivo rwakakosha pamusoro pedata:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.data.format"
msgstr "<strong>Fomati?</strong> <a %(blog)s>Anna’s Archive Containers (AAC)</a>, iyo inonyanya <a %(jsonlines)s>JSON Lines</a> yakamanikidzwa ne <a %(zstd)s>Zstandard</a>, pamwe nemamwe semantics akajairwa. Aya makontena anovhara marudzi akasiyana emarekodhi, zvichienderana nekutakura kwakasiyana kwatakaita."

