msgid "page.metadata.openlib.howto.item.4"
msgstr "Pasi pe “ID Numbers” sarudza “Anna’s Archive” uye wedzera MD5 yebhuku kubva kuAnna’s Archive. Iyi ndiyo tambo refu yemavara nenhamba mushure me “/md5/” muURL."

