#, fuzzy
msgid "page.volunteering.section.bounties.heading"
msgstr "Mabhadharo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "page.volunteering.section.bounties.text1"
msgstr "Tinenge tichigara tichitsvaga vanhu vane hunyanzvi hwakasimba hwekugadzira mapurogiramu kana kuchengetedza kuchengetedzwa kwekuchengetedza kuti vabatane nesu. Unogona kuita basa rakakura mukuchengetedza nhaka yevanhu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "page.volunteering.section.bounties.text2"
msgstr "Sechiratidzo chekutenda, tinopa nhengo kune avo vanoita mipiro yakasimba. Sechiratidzo chikuru chekutenda, tinopa mabhadharo emari kumabasa akakosha uye akaoma. Izvi hazvifanirwe kutorwa senzvimbo yebasa, asi zvinowedzera kukurudzira uye zvinogona kubatsira nemitengo inowanikwa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "page.volunteering.section.bounties.text3"
msgstr "Mazhinji emapurogiramu edu akavhurika, uye tichakumbira kuti mapurogiramu ako ave akavhurika zvakare kana uchipihwa mubhadharo. Pane dzimwe dzakasarudzika dzatinogona kukurukura pamunhu mumwe nemumwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "page.volunteering.section.bounties.text4"
msgstr "Mabhadharo anopihwa kumunhu wekutanga kupedzisa basa. Inzwa wakasununguka kutaura pane tikiti remubhadharo kuti vamwe vazive kuti uri kushanda pane chimwe chinhu, kuitira kuti vamwe vamire kana kukubata kuti mubatane. Asi cherechedza kuti vamwe vachiri vakasununguka kushanda pazviri uye kuyedza kukukunda. Zvisinei, hatipi mabhadharo pabasa risina kunaka. Kana mipiro miviri yemhando yepamusoro ikaitwa padyo neimwe (mukati memazuva maviri), tinogona kusarudza kupa mabhadharo kune vese, pakufunga kwedu, semuenzaniso 100%% kune wekutanga uye 50%% kune wechipiri (saka 150%% zvese)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "page.volunteering.section.bounties.text5"
msgstr "Kune mabhadharo makuru (kunyanya mabhadharo ekukweva data), tapota taura nesu kana wapedza ~5%% yacho, uye une chivimbo chekuti nzira yako ichakwanisa kusvika pachinangwa chizere. Uchafanirwa kugovera nzira yako nesu kuti tigone kupa mhinduro. Zvakare, nenzira iyi tinogona kusarudza zvekuita kana paine vanhu vakawanda vari kuswedera padyo nemubhadharo, sekupa mubhadharo kune vanhu vakawanda, kukurudzira vanhu kuti vabatane, nezvimwe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "page.volunteering.section.bounties.text6"
msgstr "YAMBIRO: mabasa ane mabhadharo akakwirira <span %(bold)s>akaoma</span> — zvinogona kunge zvakanaka kutanga neari nyore."

#, fuzzy
msgid "page.volunteering.section.bounties.text7"
msgstr "Enda kune yedu <a %(a_gitlab)s>Gitlab issues list</a> uye sarudza ne “Label priority”. Izvi zvinoratidza roughly kurongeka kwemabasa atinokoshesa. Mabasa asina mabhadharo akajeka achiri kukodzera nhengo, kunyanya ayo akamaka “Accepted” uye “Anna’s favorite”. Unogona kuda kutanga ne “Starter project”."

